c34470', 'word_count': 819, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc6f3a9f-ce6d-5c55-a000-fe822bc34470'}, {'abstract': 'We’re facing dismal growth and an economy that leaves millions of Americans out of work and out of luck. It’s time for a shock to the system.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/01/opinion/why-this-economy-needs-donald-trump.html', 'snippet': 'We’re facing dismal growth and an economy that leaves millions of Americans out of work and out of luck. It’s time for a shock to the system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year, the media has been focused largely on the election process — campaign managers, speaking styles, every slip and misstep. That’s been entertaining, but the policy differences between the two sides are much more important, and the most crucial difference may be over economic policy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/01/opinion/01malpassWeb/01malpassWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/01/opinion/01malpassWeb/01malpassWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/01/opinion/01malpassWeb/01malpassWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/01/opinion/01malpassWeb/01malpassWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/01/opinion/01malpassWeb/01malpassWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't