ikander.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “The Light Between Oceans,” a married couple, Tom and Isabel (Michael Fassbender and Alicia Vikander) live on a remote island off the coast of Australia. They long to be parents but Isabel has suffered two miscarriages. In this scene, the two find a boat that washes ashore and are surprised to see what’s inside.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Derek Cianfrance Narrates a Scene From ‘The Light Between Oceans’', 'kicker': 'Anatomy of a Scene', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cianfrance, Derek', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fassbender, Michael', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vikander, Alicia (1988- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Light Between Oceans (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-01T16:25:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa4a9b57-8523-57e6-b36f-20577588717c', 'word_count': 520, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa4a9b57-8523-57e6-b36f-20577588717c'}, {'abstract': 'Michael Fassbender and Alicia Vikander play an Australian couple who long for a child — and happen to find one — in this post-World War I romance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/02/movies/the-light-between-oceans-review.html', 'snippet': 'Michael Fassbender and Alicia Vikander play an Australian couple who long for a child — and happen to find one — in this post-World War I romance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “The Light Between Oceans,” Michael Fassbender exudes the war-weary stoicism of a man who has grown numb from witnessing too much senseless carnage. Tom Sherbourne, his character in this sweeping period romance adapted from M. L. Stedman’s 2012 novel, is an embittered World War I veteran who takes a job as a lighthouse keeper on Janus Rock, a remote, uninhabited island on the edge of Western Australia. His hope is to get as far as possible from civilization and its savagery.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/02/arts/02LIGHTjp/02LIGHTjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/02/arts/02LIGHTjp/02LIGHTjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/02/arts/02LIGHTjp/02LIGHTjp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/02/arts/02LIGHTjp/02LIGHTjp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/02/arts/02LIGHTjp/02LIGHTjp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/02/arts/02LIGHTjp/02LIGHTjp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/02/arts/02LIGHTjp/02LIGHTjp-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge