e remote reaches of the Pacific.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/02/us/politics/obama-climate-change-midway-marine-monument.html', 'snippet': 'The president, an eye on his legacy, recognized the expansion of the Papahanaumokuakea Marine National Monument in the remote reaches of the Pacific.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIDWAY ATOLL — President Obama, taking his campaign to confront climate change to a pristine spit of land in the remote Pacific Ocean, said on Thursday that it was critical to examine the effects of the planet’s warming on the seas and to protect wild areas from degradation caused by human activity.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Visits Midway, Highlighting Monument and Commitment to Environment', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Takes Climate-Change Battle to Midway', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Midway Atoll', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Julie Hirschfeld', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coral', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oceans and Seas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fish and Other Marine Life', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'National Parks, Monuments and Seashores', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-02T00:28:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Hirschfeld Davis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': 'Hirschfeld', 'lastname': 'Davis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3bb344b-3e49-596f-af9b-4d6