e38-935f4b2abccf'}, {'abstract': 'Readers solve the case of a 50-year-old woman back from Kenya who develops a fever and vomiting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/02/well/live/think-like-a-doctor-the-sick-traveler-solved.html', 'snippet': 'Readers solve the case of a 50-year-old woman back from Kenya who develops a fever and vomiting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Thursday, we challenged Well readers to take on the complicated case of a 50-year-old woman who felt feverish and couldn’t stop vomiting and who ended up losing a lot of weight. Like the doctors who saw her as she searched for a diagnosis, many of you focused on her recent journey to Kenya as the source of her symptoms. It was a completely reasonable approach, and one that was extensively explored by the doctors who cared for her. But ultimately it was incorrect.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/health/29well_diagnosis/29well_diagnosis-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 280, 'width': 400, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/health/29well_diagnosis/29well_diagnosis-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 280, 'width': 400, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/health/29well_diagnosis/29well_diagnosis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/02/29/health/29well_diagnosis/29well_diagnosis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/health/29well_diagnosis/29well_diagnosis-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'wi