 Better in Red.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even the cocktails will be stylish. Following New York Fashion Week: the shows, being held from Sept. 8 to 15, London, Milan and Paris celebrate spring 2017 fashion with their own events. The runway aside, there’s plenty going on in hotels in each city where travelers and locals alike can get a taste of the scene without attending an actual, invitation-only show. It’s a nice way to feel, well, fashionable.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/travel/11WTGN/11WTGN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 659, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/11/travel/11WTGN/11WTGN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 659}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/travel/11WTGN/11WTGN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 933, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/travel/11WTGN/11WTGN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1580, 'width': 1439, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/travel/11WTGN/11WTGN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/11/travel/11WTGN/11WTGN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/travel/11WTGN/11WTGN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 