ibune: The three were shot at dawn for an attack on a German sergeant in Paris in September 1941.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/09/06/1941-frenchmen-are-executed/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: The three were shot at dawn for an attack on a German sergeant in Paris in September 1941.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VICHY — Three French men were shot at dawn today [Sept. 6] by the German military authorities of Paris in reprisal for the shooting and slight wounding of a German sergeant near the East railroad station in Paris Wednesday night. Notice of this grim deed was communicated to the Paris population by a two-column announcement appearing on the front pages of all the Paris newspapers this morning [Sept. 6]. The act was said to be the fulfillment of the threat, made by the Germans after the killing of a Nazi ensign in a Paris subway, that they would regard all French civilians held in detention by them as hostages liable to be shot without notice if any further attempts were made on the lives of German soldiers. — New York Herald Tribune, Sept. 7, 1941', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/blogs/07iht-1941-hostages/07iht-1941-hostages-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/07/blogs/07iht-1941-hostages/07iht-1941-hostages-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/blogs/07iht-1941-hostages/07iht-1941-hostages-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/blogs/07iht-