': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/07/health/who-zika-sexual-transmission-pregnancy.html', 'snippet': 'A spokeswoman said, “We want it to be unmistakable that we are not counseling anybody toward delay.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The World Health Organization on Tuesday clarified — once again — its advice on sexual transmission of the Zika virus, saying that couples living in areas where it is circulating should be offered contraception and counseling to help decide whether to become pregnant.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/science/07ZIKA/07ZIKA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/07/science/07ZIKA/07ZIKA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/science/07ZIKA/07ZIKA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/science/07ZIKA/07ZIKA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/07/science/07ZIKA/07ZIKA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/science/07ZIKA/07ZIKA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 730, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/science/07ZIKA/07ZIKA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1460, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'W.H.O. Clarifies Advice on Sex and Pregnancy in Zika Regions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'W.H.O. Clarifies Advice on Sex and Pregnancy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Zika Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McNeil, Donald G Jr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexually Transmitted Diseases', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-07T01:33:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Donald G. McNeil Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Donald', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'McNeil', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/386c5bd5-bcba-5ee9-8358-cfb417430fbd', 'word_count': 568, 'uri': 'nyt://article/386c5bd5-bcba-5ee9-8358-cfb417430fbd'}, {'abstract': 'This blog isn’t all there is.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/09/06/read-me-on-twitter/', 'snippet': 'This blog isn’t all there is.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has come to my attention that some long-time blog followers aren’t aware that I am now Tweeting directly, and that this has to some extent displaced my blogging — especially when it comes to political commentary. If you don’t know about this, you should check it out. You don’t need to be on Twitter yourself, although if you are I’m @paulkrugman. As long as you are online, just go here — twitter dot com slash paulkrugman.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Read Me On Twitter!', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'na