08fe-513c-92a6-7e49ec31fb89', 'word_count': 572, 'uri': 'nyt://article/956d26bf-08fe-513c-92a6-7e49ec31fb89'}, {'abstract': 'The 86-year-old Conserveira de Lisboa sells over 130 types — including squid in ink, smoked octopus and a variety of fish eggs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/07/t-magazine/food/tinned-fish-shop-conserveira-de-lisboa.html', 'snippet': 'The 86-year-old Conserveira de Lisboa sells over 130 types — including squid in ink, smoked octopus and a variety of fish eggs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With World War II looming, the owners of a little grocery store in Lisbon made two big decisions. First, they decided to specialize in tinned fish, which would be easier to stock and export than a wider range of groceries — and, in a move that was rather rare at the time, they began to register their own brands. “A bet they made 86 years ago really paid off,” says Tiago Cabral Ferreira, whose grandfather was one of the initial owners of Conserveira de Lisboa, which still, to this day, sells only tinned fish. Without such forward thinking, the shop would likely be long gone.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/09/t-magazine/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/09/t-magazine/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/09/t-magazine/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/09/t-magazine/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/09/t-magazine/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/09/t-magazine/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/09/t-magazine/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI/09tmag-onethingshop-slide-3QOI-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'One-Thing Shop: Tinned Fish, Lisbon', 'kicker': 'One-Thing Shops', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One-Thing Shops; A Store That Sells Only Tinned Fish', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lisbon (Portugal)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Portugal', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fish and Other Marine Life', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Supermarkets and Grocery Stores', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-07T18:29:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Ronan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ronan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66a8af36-4b90-5e0a-9d38-67eff97c56fa', 'word_count': 727, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66a8af36-4b90-5e0a-9d38-67eff97c56fa'}, {'abstract': 'The legendary model, who is a mentor at this season’s VFiles show, spoke to T about how things have changed since she started out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/07/t-magazine/fashion/naomi-campbell-vfiles-interview.html', 'snippet': 'The legendary model, who is a mentor at this season’s VFiles show, spoke to T about how things have changed since she started out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the eve of VFiles’s fashion-week show, Naomi Campbell — who has been cast as one of the program’s mentors along with the stylist Mel Ottenberg, the makeup artist Pat McGrath, the Fear of God designer Jerry Lorenzo and the rapper Young Thug — was crouching down in a vintage dress and corset to look at designer mood boards and talk to each of the five designers who will present their collections at the group show on Wednesday night. “It’s an honor to see what’s new and young in fashion,” she told T. Below, Campbell talks about whether she feels models on the runway have become more diverse — and how being a model has changed since she began working in the 1980s.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/t-magazine/07tmag-naomi01/07tmag-naomi01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/07/t-magazine/07tmag-naomi01/07tmag-naomi01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/t-magazine/07tmag-naomi01/07tmag-naomi01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/07/t