live pianist embedded in it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2016/09/08/t-magazine/art/rashid-johnsons-fly-away.html', 'snippet': 'Inside the artist’s new show at Hauser & Wirth, including paintings, sculptures and a plant-based installation with a live pianist embedded in it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Inside the artist’s new show at Hauser & Wirth, including paintings, sculptures and a plant-based installation with a live pianist embedded in it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/08/t-magazine/art/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 424, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/08/t-magazine/art/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 424}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/08/t-magazine/art/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 723, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/08/t-magazine/art/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1447, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/08/t-magazine/art/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/08/t-magazine/art/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/08/t-magazine/art/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM/rashid-johnson-slide-I9KM-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rashid Johnson’s “Fly Away”', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-09-08T20:19:20+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'T Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Art', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/18802522-9b1c-5e1b-9fe9-00256c8d0044', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/18802522-9b1c-5e1b-9fe9-00256c8d0044'}, {'abstract': 'Rashid Johnson’s much-anticipated new show incorporates a giant sculpture created with greenery, lights, video — and a pianist performing inside.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/08/t-magazine/art/rashid-johnson-hauser-wirth-antoine-baldwin.html', 'snippet': 'Rashid Johnson’s much-anticipated new show incorporates a giant sculpture created with greenery, lights, video — and a pianist performing inside.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the Friday before Labor Day, the New York-based artist Rashid Johnson was shooting hoops outside the city and talking about his new show at Hauser & Wirth that comprises 14 new pieces, including a monumental sculpture installation that integrates a live piano performance. Music has always been an inspiration for Johnson, who first made art-world waves when three of his large-scale photographic portraits were included in Thelma Golden’s landmark 2001 “Freestyle” exhibition at the Studio Museum in Harlem. And it’s often been physically represented in his practice: Album covers have prominently figured into his installations in the past. But the live audio element of the upcoming Hauser & Wirth show — one of the New York art season’s most anticipated, named “Fly Away” after the gospel hymn — is a first for the artist.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Giant Art Installation With 250 Plants — and Live Jazz', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sculpture', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hauser & Wirth', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Rashid (1977- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-08T20:19:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Art', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gay Gassmann', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gassmann', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d2ad9b6-8ece-507d-9bb5-420c3cc4dc4c', 'word_count': 471, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d2ad9b6-8ece-507d-9bb5-420c3cc4dc4c'}, {'abstract': 'The owners of the club have canceled a concert, citing a platform of groups affiliated with Black Lives Matter that calls Israel “an apartheid state.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/09/theater/black-lives-matter-benefit-feinsteins-54-below-canceled-israel.html', 'snippet': 'The owners of the club have canceled a concert, citing a platform of groups affiliated with Black Lives Matter that calls Israel “an apartheid state.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'A popular Broadway cabaret club has canceled a concert benefiting Black Lives Matter, citing the movement’s criticism of Israel.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge