titudes and Other Obsessions,” a collection of images from Suzanne Koller’s two-decade-long career, is out this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/08/t-magazine/art/suzanne-koller-red-lips-attitudes-other-obsessions.html', 'snippet': '“Red Lips, Attitudes and Other Obsessions,” a collection of images from Suzanne Koller’s two-decade-long career, is out this week.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Attitude: that’s the first thing I notice about a woman, more than something physical or the clothes,” says Suzanne Koller, the Austrian-born fashion director of French Vogue and the co-founder of the revered biannual fashion magazine Self Service. It’s a philosophy reflected in the title of her first monograph, out this week: “Red Lips, Attitudes and Other Obsessions.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Classic Pictures From a Stylist’s 20 Years in Fashion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-08T21:53:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Art', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kin Woo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Woo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/05d9e285-dec4-51db-9252-4443bab5813e', 'word_count': 597, 'uri': 'nyt://article/05d9e285-dec4-51db-9252-4443bab5813e'}, {'abstract': 'Here’s what you need to know at the end of the day.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/08/briefing/gary-johnson-donald-trump-wells-fargo.html', 'snippet': 'Here’s what you need to know at the end