'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/05114459-0768-5610-83f1-3264404b559b', 'word_count': 1170, 'uri': 'nyt://article/05114459-0768-5610-83f1-3264404b559b'}, {'abstract': 'A decision that threw out Connecticut’s education financing system as unconstitutional spoke to a larger nationwide truth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/09/nyregion/crux-of-connecticut-judges-grim-ruling-schools-are-broken.html', 'snippet': 'A decision that threw out Connecticut’s education financing system as unconstitutional spoke to a larger nationwide truth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When a Connecticut judge threw out the state’s school financing system as unconstitutional this week, his unsparing 90-page ruling read and resonated like a cry from the heart on the failings of American public education.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An F-Minus for America’s Schools From a Fed-Up Judge', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Crux of Grim Ruling: Schools Are Broken', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zernike, Kate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moukawsher, Thomas G (1962- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-09T01:33:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Zernike', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zernike', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/26e2fd3c-ee9e-51bd-aa47-bb513883b23b', 'word_count': 1300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26e2fd3c-ee9e-51bd-aa47-bb513883b23b'}, {'abstract': 'Moderators at future presidential debates must do a better job of holding the candidates accountable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/09/opinion/a-debate-disaster-waiting-to-happen.html', 'snippet': 'Moderators at future presidential debates must do a better job of holding the candidates accountable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was not much of a contest in Wednesday night’s forum with Hillary Clinton and Donald Trump. Mrs. Clinton answered the questions of the moderator, Matt Lauer, in coherent sentences, often with specific details. Mr. Trump alternated between rambling statements and grandiose boasts when he wasn’t lying.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/09/opinion/09thu1web/09thu1web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/09/opinion/09thu1web/09thu1web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/09/opinion/09thu1web/09thu1web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/09/opinion/09thu1web/09thu1web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/09/opinion/09thu1web/09thu1web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/09/opinion/09thu1web/09thu1web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75,