-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/blogs/10oldiht-1916-drmenard/10oldiht-1916-drmenard-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/blogs/10oldiht-1916-drmenard/10oldiht-1916-drmenard-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 969, 'width': 1377, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/blogs/10oldiht-1916-drmenard/10oldiht-1916-drmenard-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/10/blogs/10oldiht-1916-drmenard/10oldiht-1916-drmenard-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/blogs/10oldiht-1916-drmenard/10oldiht-1916-drmenard-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1916: Doctor Loses Finger to X-rays', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'X-Rays', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-09T12:53:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1b456769-c9a1-53d5-be0a-d8d07fd4852a', 'word_count': 150, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b456769-c9a1-53d5-be0a-d8d07fd4852a'}, {'abstract': 'As an updated version of “The Blair Witch Project” comes to theaters, the directors of the original film recall the impact it had on horror movies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/11/movies/blair-witch-shaky-cams-that-left-audiences-shaking.html', 'snippet': 'As an updated version of “The Blair Witch Project” comes to theaters, the directors of the original film recall the impact it had on horror movies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When “Blair Witch” opens in theaters on Friday, Sept. 16, it will probably play to a crowd of moviegoers who were barely walking when the first  film, “The Blair Witch Project,” now a found-footage classic, was released in 1999. That’s fine with the directors of the original film, Daniel Myrick and Eduardo Sánchez; they have given the update their blessing and are credited as executive producers. “Enough time has passed where the new one can be embraced on its own merits,” Mr. Myrick said. “A whole bunch of young horror fans want to see a new ‘Blair Witch’ they can call their own.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/arts/11BLAIRWITCH/11BLAIRWITCH-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 413, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/11/arts/11BLAIRWITCH/11BLAIRWITCH-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 413}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/arts/11BLAIRWITCH/11BLAIRWITCH-jumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 705, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None,