ain (Technology)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Virtual Currency', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-09T18:36:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Lumb', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lumb', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ce9a751-814d-52d2-83fd-e1ec336a780b', 'word_count': 766, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ce9a751-814d-52d2-83fd-e1ec336a780b'}, {'abstract': 'A reader asks if this will mean less information disclosed to the public about the details of such operations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/10/opinion/privatizing-drones.html', 'snippet': 'A reader asks if this will mean less information disclosed to the public about the details of such operations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Privatizing Drones', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Privatizing Drones', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Privatization', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drones (Pilotless Planes)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-09T18:40:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/151f10b1-06a3-5594-81bf-c79d3890ae54', 'word_count': 76, 'uri': 'nyt://article/151f10b1-06a3-5594-81bf-c79d3890ae54'}, {'abstract': 'Last week’s top galas included the Hampton Classic Grand Prix, and the 9/11 Memorial Dinner at Cipriani Wall Street.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/11/fashion/show-jumping-and-celebrity-spotting-in-the-hamptons-wall-streeters-host-9-11-memorial-dinner.html', 'snippet': 'Last week’s top galas included the Hampton Classic Grand Prix, and the 9/11 Memorial Dinner at Cipriani Wall Street.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael R. Bloomberg hosted his annual 9/11 Memorial Dinner, a benefit for the National September 11 Memorial and Museum, on Sept. 7 at Cipriani Wall Street. The event honored Ronald O. Perelman and Michael L. Corbat of Citigroup, and raised $3 million. The Hampton Classic Grand Prix on Sept. 4 capped off the summer social calendar, featuring world-class show jumping and celebrity spotting on a gorgeous Sunday afternoon.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Show Jumping and Celebrity Spotting in the Hamptons; Wall Streeters Host 9/11 Memorial Dinner', 'kicker': 'Scene City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Show Jumping and Remembering 9/11', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Denny', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National September 11 Memorial and Museum', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horsemanship and Equestrian Events', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-09T18:40:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denny Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/835b39a2-9239-5b6f-ad53-33719997cd56', 'word_co