nited match, has done more than consume Manchester, England, this week. It has revived the city itself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/10/sports/soccer/manchester-united-manchester-city-derby.html', 'snippet': 'Soccer, in the form of Saturday’s City-United match, has done more than consume Manchester, England, this week. It has revived the city itself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANCHESTER, England — It is what Gary Neville sees from the roof terrace of his hotel that gives him a sense that something is happening. Not the immediate view to his right of the Sir Alex Ferguson Stand at Old Trafford, with the words “Manchester United” — the club Neville supported, represented and captained — emblazoned in neon red. Neville points, instead, to the view on his distant left.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10MANCHESTERweb2/10MANCHESTERweb2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10MANCHESTERweb2/10MANCHESTERweb2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10MANCHESTERweb2/10MANCHESTERweb2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10MANCHESTERweb2/10MANCHESTERweb2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10MANCHESTERweb2/10MANCHESTERweb2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10MANCHESTERweb2/10MANCHESTERweb2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10MANCHESTERweb2/10MANCHESTERweb2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Manchester Renowned, and Redrawn, by Its Soccer', 'kicker': 'On Soccer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Renaissance, With Soccer as Its Catalyst  ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Rory', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'English Premier League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester City (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester United (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manchester (England)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-09T20:15:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rory Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rory', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97ac7b2e-21f6-52e5-9541-24c37170fc91', 'word_count': 1236, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97ac7b2e-21f6-52e5-9541-24c37170fc91'}, {'abstract': 'The Twitter co-founder shares the titles he would most want with him on a desert island.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/09/t-magazine/entertainment/ev-williams-favorite-books.html', 'snippet': 'The Twitter co-founder shares the titles he