GJ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/08/t-magazine/08tmag-amato-slide-KGGJ/08tmag-amato-slide-KGGJ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/08/t-magazine/08tmag-amato-slide-KGGJ/08tmag-amato-slide-KGGJ-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Kevin Amato Casts New York Fashion Week', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-09-09T21:23:59+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'T Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/7410dc86-2d80-597f-b648-46963aa989ee', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/7410dc86-2d80-597f-b648-46963aa989ee'}, {'abstract': 'Kevin Amato, who releases a new book of his photography this week, takes T behind the scenes of his street casting for several runway shows.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/09/t-magazine/fashion/kevin-amato-importants-book-casting-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'Kevin Amato, who releases a new book of his photography this week, takes T behind the scenes of his street casting for several runway shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kevin Amato is something of a multihyphenate: He casts several fashion week shows — including, this season, VFiles, Band of Outsiders and Kith — and this week has released a new book of photography, “The Importants,” featuring over 200 images culled from his years spent taking pictures. Amato focuses on “street casting,” picking models he finds on the street — or, increasingly, on Instagram — who typically don’t conform to the traditional look of models in the industry. Amato also runs his own Instagram talent agency. This season, he held an open casting call for the VFiles show, which attracted hundreds of young hopefuls (including one who made the trip up from Florida). Amato captured his process of scouting for the show, as well as late-night pizza, exclusively for T.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What It’s Like to Cast a Fashion Week Show', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-09T21:24:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabel Wilkinson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilkinson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bcccac56-2778-58bc-8878-fce6d8b10519', 'word_count': 130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bcccac56-2778-58bc-8878-fce6d8b10519'}, {'abstract': 'Prosecutors acknowledged for the first time on Friday that Mr. Regeni had been under investigation before he disappeared. Egypt has denied that security officials played a role in his killing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/10/world/middleeast/egypt-italy-giulio-regeni.html', 'snippet': 'Prosecutors acknowledged for the first time on Friday that Mr. Regeni had been under investigation before he disappeared. Egypt has denied that security officials played a role in his killing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO, Egypt — Egyptian security officers investigated an Italian graduate student 