4eaa-aa88-5d8e-929a-f2d22670a36c'}, {'abstract': 'Opponents said loosening of regulations would exploit investors and threaten retirement savings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/10/business/dealbook/critics-are-lining-up-to-oppose-changes-to-dodd-frank-law.html', 'snippet': 'Opponents said loosening of regulations would exploit investors and threaten retirement savings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Buyout firms are at the forefront of Capitol Hill. They have successfully promoted legislation to roll back regulatory disclosures required under the postcrisis Dodd-Frank legislation, even as they settle cases over misleading investors. If the bill is enacted, however, there is a risk of repercussions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Critics Are Lining Up to Oppose Changes to Dodd-Frank Law', 'kicker': 'Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Equity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-09T21:56:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gina Chon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89e90420-f8c9-5f52-84f1-0810627ce7c0', 'word_count': 388, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89e90420-f8c9-5f52-84f1-0810627ce7c0'}, {'abstract': 'The defining gag of this Fox comedy is that the divorced father, Zorn, is an animated He-Man-style warrior, while everyone else in the show is real.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/10/arts/television/review-in-son-of-zorn-the-dads-dense-and-drawn-that-way.html', 'snippet': 'The defining gag of this Fox comedy is that the divorced father, Zorn, is an animated He-Man-style warrior, while everyone else in the show is real.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are plenty of jokes in “Son of Zorn.” There’s the one when Zorn’s ex-wife asks if he owns a shirt, and he says, “Does a Gryffian herdsman have nine anuses?” There’s the one when his son tries to convince a predictably chauvinistic Zorn that his new boss is, in fact, a woman, and Zorn replies: “No, son, you’re not listening to me. He’s my superior.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/arts/10ZORN/10ZORN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/10/arts/10ZORN/10ZORN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/arts/10ZORN/10ZORN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/arts/10ZORN/10ZORN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1281, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/arts/10ZORN/10ZORN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/10/arts/10ZORN/10ZORN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 