es.com/2016/09/10/us/politics/donald-trump-rally.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Trump, at a rally on Friday, escalated his attacks against Mrs. Clinton, saying that “she is being so protected.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'PENSACOLA, Fla. — Donald J. Trump, in escalating attacks against Hillary Clinton, suggested on Friday that his opponent was so immune to prosecution that she could shoot someone in front of thousands of witnesses and not be prosecuted.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Donald Trump Says Hillary Clinton Wouldn’t Be Prosecuted Even if She Shot Someone', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-10T03:50:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Corasaniti', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Corasaniti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3352e153-bebb-52c8-9988-5e121fa4bf67', 'word_count': 433, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3352e153-bebb-52c8-9988-5e121fa4bf67'}, {'abstract': 'In their final 21 regular-season games, the Mets play only three against a team with a winning record. So their postseason aspirations are very much in play.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/10/sports/baseball/rally-to-beat-the-braves-and-a-favorable-schedule-buoy-the-mets-hopes.html', 'snippet': 'In their final 21 regular-season games, the Mets play only three against a team with a winning record. So their postseason aspirations are very much in play.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — The nadir of the Mets’ season may have been Aug. 19. They were two games under .500, and five and a half games out of the second National League wild-card spot. Playoff projections had the Mets’ percentage chances of reaching the postseason in the single digits.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10-CITY-METS/10-CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10-CITY-METS/10-CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10-CITY-METS/10-CITY-METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 733, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10-CITY-METS/10-CITY-METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1466, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10-CITY-METS/10-CITY-METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/10/sports/10-CITY-METS/10-CITY-METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images