of questions about Mrs. Clinton’s health from Republicans, is likely to increase pressure on her to address the issue.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/12/us/politics/hillary-clinton-campaign-pneumonia.html', 'snippet': 'The incident, which occurred after months of questions about Mrs. Clinton’s health from Republicans, is likely to increase pressure on her to address the issue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hillary Clinton is being treated for pneumonia and dehydration, her doctor said on Sunday, hours after she abruptly left a ceremony in New York honoring the 15th anniversary of the Sept. 11 attacks and had to be helped into a van by Secret Service agents.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hillary Clinton’s Doctor Says Pneumonia Led to Abrupt Exit From 9/11 Event', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clinton Falls Ill at a 9/11 Tribute; Pneumonia Cited', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pneumonia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Jonathan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'September 11 (2001)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Trade Center (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-11T16:04:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Martin and Amy Chozick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': '