 lineup was no different — the mix of faces was both fresh and familiar, and included the doe-eyed, Colorado-bred Taylor Hill. While the 20-year-old has already landed campaigns for Miu Miu, earned her Victoria’s Secret wings and recently become the face for Lancôme, this marked her first time walking for Wang. As it turns out, last night’s runway was full of surprises; the designer announced his collaboration with Adidas at the finale. Backstage, T caught up with Hill to talk about athletic workouts, the surfer-punk-inspired hair at the show and her splash-on-skincare routine.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/t-magazine/fashion/11tmag-bbr-01/11tmag-bbr-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/11/t-magazine/fashion/11tmag-bbr-01/11tmag-bbr-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/t-magazine/fashion/11tmag-bbr-01/11tmag-bbr-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/t-magazine/fashion/11tmag-bbr-01/11tmag-bbr-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/t-magazine/fashion/11tmag-bbr-01/11tmag-bbr-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/11/t-magazine/fashion/11tmag-bbr-01/11tmag-bbr-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt