508, 'uri': 'nyt://article/471c926f-03e2-5c93-9c69-673baf1ce488'}, {'abstract': 'The approach of the 20th anniversary of this Colorado girl’s murder prompts a barrage of programming, but why?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/12/arts/television/jonbenet-ramsey-on-television.html', 'snippet': 'The approach of the 20th anniversary of this Colorado girl’s murder prompts a barrage of programming, but why?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Television can be a great unifier, and that can be a useful thing — in a time of national crisis or triumph, for instance. But not always. At the moment TV seems determined to have us all believe that we should be ghoulishly obsessed with the ugly murder of a 6-year-old girl 20 years ago.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/12/arts/12JONBENET/12JONBENET-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/12/arts/12JONBENET/12JONBENET-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/12/arts/12JONBENET/12JONBENET-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/12/arts/12JONBENET/12JONBENET-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1328, 'width': 1996, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/12/arts/12JONBENET/12JONBENET-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/12/arts/12JONBENET/12JONBENET-thumb