, 'headline': {'main': 'Eddie Antar, Retailer and Felon Who Created Crazy Eddie, Dies at 68', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Eddie Antar, Retailer and Felon Who Created Crazy Eddie, Dies at 68', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Crazy Eddie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANTAR, EDDIE', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Racketeering and Racketeers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-12T00:38:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Niraj Chokshi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Niraj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chokshi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a0817d6-9317-5b59-aed3-d11adc6fe31a', 'word_count': 641, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a0817d6-9317-5b59-aed3-d11adc6fe31a'}, {'abstract': 'Félix Auger-Aliassime of Canada and Kayla Day breezed to junior titles at the U.S. Open.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/12/sports/tennis/for-two-rising-prospects-a-day-of-victory-and-redemption.html', 'snippet': 'Félix Auger-Aliassime of Canada and Kayla Day breezed to junior titles at the U.S. Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last time Félix Auger-Aliassime was in the final of a Grand Slam junior event was in Paris, where he was seen firing his rackets onto the ground after a brutal loss. It was a match he had had on his racket three times, but he had blown each match point to Geoffrey Blancaneaux.', '