ynolds and Nicola Yoon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/13/business/media/kate-dicamillo-candidates-for-national-book-award-for-young-peoples-literature.html', 'snippet': 'Others on the National Book Award longlist include Kwame Alexander, Grace Lin, Jason Reynolds and Nicola Yoon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The National Book Foundation announced the Longlist for the 2016 National Book Award for Young People’s Literature on Monday. The 10 nominated books represent a stylistic and thematically diverse range, with fiction, a graphic memoir and nonfiction that address subjects like domestic violence, sexual identity, race, social activism and how children cope during war. The remaining longlists, for the poetry, nonfiction and fiction categories, will be announced over the next three days. Finalists will be revealed on Oct. 13, and the winners will be announced at a gala in New York City on Nov. 16.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/arts/13BOOKAWARD/13BOOKAWARD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 887, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/13/arts/13BOOKAWARD/13BOOKAWARD-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 887}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/arts/13BOOKAWARD/13BOOKAWARD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 693, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/arts/13BOOKAWARD/13BOOKAWARD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1385, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/arts/13BOOKAWARD/13BOOKAWARD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75