otany, Saturday and Sunday, noon to 5 p.m., $30 for tasting for adults 21 and older ($5 for members), New York Botanical Garden, Bronx, nybg.org.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/dining/14BURNER-BEER-WEB/14BURNER-BEER-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 901, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/14/dining/14BURNER-BEER-WEB/14BURNER-BEER-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 901}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/dining/14BURNER-BEER-WEB/14BURNER-BEER-WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/dining/14BURNER-BEER-WEB/14BURNER-BEER-WEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1364, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/dining/14BURNER-BEER-WEB/14BURNER-BEER-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/14/dining/14BURNER-BEER-WEB/14BURNER-BEER-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/dining/14BURNER-BEER-WEB/14BURNER-BEER-WEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Taste of How Beer Is Made', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Participate: Get a Taste of How Beer Is Made'