ies as Zika Results Lag in Florida', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alvarez, Lizette', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Zika Virus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tests (Medical)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Richard L', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Birth Defects', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-13T01:06:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lizette Alvarez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lizette', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alvarez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a3dbbdb-be0e-5d3a-a238-082e71342200', 'word_count': 1262, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a3dbbdb-be0e-5d3a-a238-082e71342200'}, {'abstract': 'Why misinformation spreads so quickly in this conspiracy-theory election.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/13/opinion/campaign-stops/did-you-hear-the-latest-about-hillary.html', 'snippet': 'Why misinformation spreads so quickly in this conspiracy-theory election.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hillary Clinton has pneumonia. Did you know she has a body double? She was that blond woman waving at reporters in front of Chelsea Clinton’s apartment a few hours after Mrs. Clinton felt unwell and left the Sept. 11 commemoration at ground zero.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/opinion/13tufekciWeb/13tufekciWeb-articleLa