://article/f4d43118-b4d2-56a8-bf14-079815ea23e7'}, {'abstract': 'Kuchar, Holmes and Fowler, who each have Ryder Cup experience, were selected by the team captain Davis Love III to take on Europe this month.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/13/sports/golf/matt-kuchar-jb-holmes-rickie-fowler-ryder-cup-picks.html', 'snippet': 'Kuchar, Holmes and Fowler, who each have Ryder Cup experience, were selected by the team captain Davis Love III to take on Europe this month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'INDIANAPOLIS — Phil Mickelson had already played his way on to the United States Ryder Cup team before the BMW Championship when he said that the eight automatic qualifiers “know who is going to be playing with who, when they’re going to be playing, what matches.” Mickelson’s remarks suggested that the team captain Davis Love III’s four discretionary picks were a foregone conclusion, and the three selections that Love announced on Monday did nothing to disabuse anyone of that notion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/sports/13golf-web/13golf-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/13/sports/13golf-web/13golf-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/sports/13golf-web/13golf-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/sports/13golf-web/13golf-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images