://article/19a88986-f857-53a8-b000-fe5f37451e08'}, {'abstract': 'We’re all a little weary. The presidential campaign feels like it’s been going on since 1066.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/13/opinion/campaign-stops/who-will-make-it-through-the-homestretch.html', 'snippet': 'We’re all a little weary. The presidential campaign feels like it’s been going on since 1066.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Arthur Brooks: Welcome back from the break, Gail. Two months until Election Day, and no doubt our readers have been at loose ends without being able to kick off every Tuesday with our conversation. So let’s jump back into the ring.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/opinion/13brookscollinsWeb/13brookscollinsWeb-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/13/opinion/13brookscollinsWeb/13brookscollinsWeb-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/opinion/13brookscollinsWeb/13brookscollinsWeb-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/opinion/13brookscollinsWeb/13brookscollinsWeb-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/opinion/13brookscollinsWeb/13brookscollinsWeb-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/13/opinion/13brookscollinsWeb/13brookscollinsWeb-thumbStandard-v3.jpg',