16/09/14/world/europe/germany-arrests-isis.html', 'snippet': 'The three were among the tide of migrants who arrived in Germany and may have had links to last year’s Paris attackers, the authorities said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Three Syrians who entered Germany as migrants have been arrested on suspicion of belonging to the Islamic State and may have links to those who carried out the Paris terrorist attacks last year, the authorities said on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Germany Arrests 3 Syrians on Suspicion of ISIS Ties', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Germany Says 3 From Syria Have ISIS Ties', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eddy, Melissa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and Africa Migrant Crisis', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Attacks (November 2015)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-13T11:15:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Eddy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eddy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/debd0ca5-51b1-5267-b753-7c15b4867df4', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/debd0ca5-51b1-5267-b753-7c15b4867df4'}, {'abstract': 'Mrs. Clinton’s preference for privacy backfired.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/13/opinion/chappatte-on-hillary-clintons-health.html', 'snippet