omfortable seeing in the clothes to participate, and it’s truly a collaborative process. It’s not that I want to impose my vision, it’s that I’m inspired by them.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 758, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 758}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 811, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1263, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/t-magazine/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F/13tmag-mnz-slide-XU0F-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'One Designer’s Fashion Week Fittings, Illustrated', 'kicker': None, 'content_