rwear-commando-new-york-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'Kerry O’Brien, the founder of Commando, which is working with dozens of brands during New York Fashion Week, breaks down what lies beneath.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During fashion week, hair and makeup help make the outfit, but don’t overlook the underwear. Without the right underpinnings, even the best dress can go so wrong. Little wonder that just as there are go-to beauty experts (Pat McGrath and Orlando Pita, for example), there is a go-to brand for lingerie. Commando, which not coincidentally also dominates the red carpet, is working with more than 30 brands during New York Fashion Week, including Rodarte, Rag & Bone and Zac Posen.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/fashion/13COMMANDO01/13COMMANDO01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/13/fashion/13COMMANDO01/13COMMANDO01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/fashion/13COMMANDO01/13COMMANDO01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/fashion/13COMMANDO01/13COMMANDO01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/fashion/13COMMANDO01/13COMMANDO01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/13/fashion/13COMMANDO01/13COMMANDO01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/13/fashion/13COMMANDO01/13COMMANDO01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘If You’re Thinking About Your Underwear, You’re Wearing the Wrong Underwear’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lingerie and Underwear', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Commando LLC', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Brien, Kerry (Designer)", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-14T13:34:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Valeriya Safronova', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Valeriya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Safronova', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/78ae43f0-26a9-51f2-bff1-044a4421e7da', 'word_count': 581, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78ae43f0-26a9-51f2-bff1-044a4421e7da'}, {'abstract': 'Louis Charles Breguet’s relationship to the dynamics of flight is now evoked in the new Type XXI 3817 chronograph.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/breguet-chronograph-watch.html', 'snippet': 'Louis Charles Breguet’s relationship to the dynamics of flight is now evoked in the new Type XXI 3817 chronograph.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rather than assume the mantle of the famed French watch company his family founded in the 18th century, early aviator Louis Charles Breguet decided instead to fly. While the company (now based in Switzerland) was pioneering chronographs for cockpits in the late 1920s, Louis Charles perfected the gyroplane (a helicopter precursor) and developed a reconnaissance aircraft. The watch manufacturer’s relationship to the dynamics of flight is now evoked in the new Type XXI 3817 chronograph, based on a Breguet model worn for decades by the French air force. Its steel case features a retro dove-gray dial with luminous Arabic numerals, and a slew of complications including a fly-back function and a 12-hour counter.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '114', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/t-magazine/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/25/t-magazine/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 724}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/t-magazine/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 849, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/t-magazine/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1698, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/t-magazine/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/25/t-magazine/25tmag-10qual_thing_breuget-t_CA1/25tmag-10qual_thing