n incredible amount of thought into the set design for their presentations; see last February’s domestic scene. For spring/summer 2017, a collection that includes more bag and shoe silhouettes than before (and three new materials), but a more edited color palette, they sought a minimal background, transforming the performance space Cedar Lake into a museum and coordinating gift shop. Scroll over the images to go inside last night’s presentation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mansur Gavriel Turned Its Presentation Into a Museum — and Gift Shop', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mansur Gavriel LLC', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gavriel, Floriana', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mansur, Rachel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-14T16:13:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilary Moss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e5ad1792-1cf6-5d43-8585-35055c15ec6b', 'word_count': 104, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5ad1792-1cf6-5d43-8585-35055c15ec6b'}, {'abstract': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: Floods create a disaster in Spain in September 1891.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/09/14/1891-disastrous-floods-in-spain/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: Floods create a disaster in Spain in September 1891.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MADRID — Terrible floods have been caused in the South of Spain by the overflow of the Amarguillo River. It is estimated that 1,300 persons have been drowned. The towns of Valencia, Cas’ellon and Almeria are inundated. There is at least 3ft. of water in the streets. It is not likely that there will be any railroad service south of Madrid for a week at least. The Queen Regent has sent her intendant with ten thousand douros, and has given him carte blanche in the matter of expense for the assistance of the sufferers in the Province of Toledo. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Sept. 15, 1891', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/blogs/15oldiht-1891-queenspain/15oldiht-1891-queenspain-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 465, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/blogs/15oldiht-1891-queenspain/15oldiht-1891-queenspain-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 465, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/blogs/15oldiht-1891-queenspain/15oldiht-1891-queenspain-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/15/blogs/15oldiht-1891-queenspain/15oldiht-1891-queenspain-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/blogs/15oldiht-1891-queenspain/15oldiht-1891-queenspain-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1891: Disastrous Floods in Spain', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name