ization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/07e096e7-f1ca-5afe-a71a-b5a16f9f0530', 'word_count': 531, 'uri': 'nyt://article/07e096e7-f1ca-5afe-a71a-b5a16f9f0530'}, {'abstract': 'Savvy shoppers have discovered that Florence is full of exceptional vintage finds, from antiques, furniture and clothing to retro treasures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/18/travel/five-places-to-shop-in-florence.html', 'snippet': 'Savvy shoppers have discovered that Florence is full of exceptional vintage finds, from antiques, furniture and clothing to retro treasures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Florence may be known for its current designer offerings — from the likes of Ferragamo, Gucci and Marni — but savvy shoppers have also discovered that the city is full of exceptional vintage finds, from antiques, furniture and clothing to retro treasures. In fact, in the last few years the city has welcomed a number of new secondhand shops that have only added to the richness of an already considerable vintage shopping scene.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/travel/18FORAGINGFLORENCE-3/18FORAGINGFLORENCE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/18/travel/18FORAGINGFLORENCE-3/18FORAGINGFLORENCE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/travel/18FORAGINGFLORENCE-3/18FORAGINGFLORENCE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/travel/18FORAGINGFLORENCE-3/18FORAGINGFLORENCE-superJumbo.jpg', '