 for millennials in the office.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/15/business/dealbook/review-feminist-fight-club-takes-on-workplace-sexism.html', 'snippet': 'Grounded in academic research, Jessica Bennett’s “Feminist Fight Club” is “Lean In” conceived as an illustrated guide for millennials in the office.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last 20 years has seen a reduction in many of the most blatant forms of workplace discrimination against women. A recent Harvard Business Review article reported, however, that subtle bias is often worse than the more overt variety. The very ambiguity of the behavior heightens stress and diminishes the chances of successfully seeking recourse, legal or otherwise. This could explain, in part, the stubborn persistence of the wage gap and continued underrepresentation of women in top corporate and professional roles — despite decades of women outnumbering and outperforming men through college.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/business/db-bookentry1/db-bookentry1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 648, 'width': 500, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/business/db-bookentry1/db-bookentry1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 648, 'width': 500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/business/db-bookentry1/db-bookentry1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/15/business/db-bookentry1/db-bookentry1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/business/db-bookentry1/db-bookentry1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Feminist Fight Club’ Takes On Workplace Sexism', 'kicker': 'Book Entry', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Feminist Fight Club: An Office Survival Manual (For a Sexist Workplace) (Book)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bennett, Jessica', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Workplace Environment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-14T17:26:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan A. Knee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Knee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/424c3975-34dc-5bc0-b9dc-31262c316633', 'word_count': 742, 'uri': 'nyt://article/424c3975-34dc-5bc0-b9dc-31262c316633'}, {'abstract': 'When the pop singer put down her lipstick and eye shadow, she shook up the internet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/15/fashion/alicia-keys-no-makeup-beauty-movement.html', 'snippet': 'When the pop singer put down her lipstick and eye shadow, she shook up the internet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was the Friday before Labor Day, and Alicia Keys, the 35-year-old pop star, was on the “Today” show performing for the program’s summer concert series — she’s about to release a new album, and she wrote the theme song for “Queen of Katwe,” out next week. There was a lot to talk about. But instead, Ms. Keys spent most of her time talking about makeup (and not wearing it) with the anchors Tamron Hall, Billy Bush and Al Roker, who were doggedly wiping the pancake off their faces.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/fashion/15NOMAKEUPJP1/15NOMAKEUPJP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/15/fashion/15NOMAKEUPJP1/15NOMAKEUPJP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/fashion/15NOMAKEUPJP1/15NOMAKEUPJP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/fashion/15NOMAKEUPJP1/15NOMAKEUPJP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1323, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/fashion/15NOMAKEUPJP1/15NOMAKEUPJP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/15/fashion/15NOMAKEUPJP1/15NOMAKEUPJP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/15/fashion/15NOMAKEUPJP1/15NOMAKEUPJP1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Alicia Keys and the ‘Tyranny of Makeup’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_h