r has an obligation to elicit the truth, a writer says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Debate Moderator’s Role', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Debate Moderator’s Role', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wallace, Chris (1947- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Political)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-14T18:37:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/ccb8856c-c057-5d58-9b3b-1793c95ecdb4', 'word_count': 100, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ccb8856c-c057-5d58-9b3b-1793c95ecdb4'}, {'abstract': 'Backstage at Michael Kors, Mayowa Nicholas caught up with T to discuss her tricks for radiant skin, favorite hair products and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/michael-kors-beauty-new-york-fashion-week-mayowa-nicholas.html', 'snippet': 'Backstage at Michael Kors, Mayowa Nicholas caught up with T to discuss her tricks for radiant skin, favorite hair products and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Backstage at Michael Kors’ spring/summer 2017 show, the mix of models represented exactly what the designer had in mind: “I really wanted diversity as far as the look of the girls, and diversity as far as body types,” he said. And in between supernovas from Kendall Jenner to Carolyn Murphy, stood the striking 5’ 11” Mayowa Nicholas, a newcomer who only began modeling two years ago but has already made quite a mark. Since winning an Elite modeling competition in her native Nigeria in 2014, Nicholas has walked for a number of top-tier European fashion houses including Christian Dior, Prada, Miu Miu, Hermès and Loewe. (After closing Loewe, Nicholas posted on Instagram: “Dreams do come true.”) Last fall, Nicholas became the first Nigerian model to star in a Dolce & Gabbana ad campaign — a milestone moment not only for the Lagos-born beauty, but the industry as a whole. T caught up with Nicholas to talk about her debut at New York Fashion Week this season, her beauty secrets and why Kors is a true fashion king.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-bbr-01/14tmag-bbr-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-bbr-01/14tmag-bbr-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 713}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-bbr-01/14tmag-bbr-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 862, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-bbr-01/14tmag-bbr-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1724, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-bbr-01/14tmag-bbr-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-bbr-01/14tmag-bbr-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-bbr-01/14tmag-bbr-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_