ia Beckham, Alexander Wang and Phillip Lim make the case for no shirt, no problem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While some designers this season took the concept of the classic pinstriped shirt and turned it on its head — others eschewed shirts altogether. Alexander Wang sent a lace-trimmed bra down the runway, poking out from under a tuxedo jacket, Victoria Beckham showed a crushed-silk version with matching trousers — and Phillip Lim paired a silk bra with a Western-inspired embroidered jacket.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-3trend01/14tmag-3trend01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-3trend01/14tmag-3trend01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-3trend01/14tmag-3trend01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 763, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-3trend01/14tmag-3trend01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1525, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-3trend01/14tmag-3trend01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-3trend01/14tmag-3trend01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/fashion/14tmag-3trend01/14tmag-3trend01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Three’s a Trend: Luxe Silk Bra Tops', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lingerie and Underwear', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beckham, Victoria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lim, Phillip', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wang, Alexander (1983- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-14T19:53:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Angela Koh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Angela', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Koh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee978023-9706-5fdf-8e0e-2f7f239aed24', 'word_count': 62, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee978023-9706-5fdf-8e0e-2f7f239aed24'}, {'abstract': 'With her spring collection, the designer tries on sex appeal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/15/fashion/gabriela-hearst-spring-2017-new-york-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'With her spring collection, the designer tries on sex appeal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gabriela Hearst is a natural ambassador for wool. She grew up, as has been lavishly documented in the press, on a ranch in Uruguay with thousands of sheep, though she has since relocated to an expensive ZIP code in Manhattan. She requires little prodding to celebrate wool’s versatility and its strength.', 'source': 'The 