zine/travel/gabriel-prokofiev-london-music-guide.html', 'snippet': 'Ahead of his stateside symphonic debut, and just in time for fashion week, Gabriel Prokofiev shares some of his favorite local haunts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Hackney, an East London neighborhood comparable to Bushwick in Brooklyn, the classical composer Gabriel Prokofiev finds himself surrounded by (and seeking out) global, underground music — at local pubs, restaurants, shops and, of course, the nighttime warehouses where Prokofiev grew up going to raves in the mid to late ’90s. “But I’m not clubbing as much as I used to because I have to be a bit more present now,” says the 41-year-old, who’s making waves for remixing classical music, with layers of contemporary influences.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/travel/hackney-slide-CPGL/hackney-slide-CPGL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/travel/hackney-slide-CPGL/hackney-slide-CPGL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/travel/hackney-slide-CPGL/hackney-slide-CPGL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/travel/hackney-slide-CPGL/hackney-slide-CPGL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/t-magazine/travel/hackney-slide-CPGL/hackney-slide-CPGL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'th