er since 2005, will give her farewell performances with the company, at the Metropolitan Opera House, on June 19 and June 23, 2017. She will dance the role of Tatiana in John Cranko’s “Onegin,” with Marcelo Gomes. Ms. Vishneva, 40, is also a principal dancer with the Mariinsky Ballet in St. Petersburg, and will remain with that company.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16VISHNEVA/16VISHNEVA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 595, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16VISHNEVA/16VISHNEVA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 595}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16VISHNEVA/16VISHNEVA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1016, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16VISHNEVA/16VISHNEVA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1576, 'width': 1589, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16VISHNEVA/16VISHNEVA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16VISHNEVA/16VISHNEVA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16VISHNEVA/16VISHNEVA-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Diana Vishneva to Leave American Ballet Theater in June'