': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31c435ea-3d4e-5fff-b496-cf46519f7c64', 'word_count': 869, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31c435ea-3d4e-5fff-b496-cf46519f7c64'}, {'abstract': 'A romantic drama filmed in a remote part of Vanuatu, in the South Pacific, tells a “Romeo and Juliet” story with a cast of villagers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/16/movies/tanna-review.html', 'snippet': 'A romantic drama filmed in a remote part of Vanuatu, in the South Pacific, tells a “Romeo and Juliet” story with a cast of villagers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Named for the remote South Pacific island where it was filmed, “Tanna” is a movie in which every single shot is picturesque, and more than a few of them are genuinely beautiful. For a North American viewer, it may serve two functions of cinema: showing a remote and unfamiliar place and culture, while also kicking up questions of how Western cinema sees cultural difference.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16TANNA/16TANNA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16TANNA/16TANNA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16TANNA/16TANNA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16TANNA/16TANNA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/arts/16TANNA/16TANNA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height':