’t easy for anyone, but it’s especially harrowing for a cancer patient.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Inside our new condo, the internet connection had failed. Two young men, sent by the cable company, had spent hours burying a cable to replace an antiquated line running into the building. As soon as they drove off, nothing worked anymore: not the landline, not the television, not the internet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/science/wellphone/wellphone-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/16/science/wellphone/wellphone-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/science/wellphone/wellphone-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/science/wellphone/wellphone-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1202, 'width': 1761, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/science/wellphone/wellphone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/16/science/wellphone/wellphone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/science/wellphone/wellphone-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Unplugged and Unmoored', 'kicker': 'Living With Cancer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cancer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Mail', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-15T21:06:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Well', 'section_name': 'Well', 'subsection_name': 'Live', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Gubar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gubar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7c69486-fa3f-5f28-87cc-35c65898fc20', 'word_count': 693, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7c69486-fa3f-5f28-87cc-35c65898fc20'}, {'abstract': 'JACK Quartet and Brooklyn Rider are bouncing all over town and tackling new challenges in a full calendar of events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/18/arts/music/a-new-season-for-reshuffled-mature-string-quartets-jack-quartet-brooklyn-rider.html', 'snippet': 'JACK Quartet and Brooklyn Rider are bouncing all over town and tackling new challenges in a full calendar of events.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two string quartets have defined New York’s new-music scene over the past decade. The JACK Quartet has made a specialty of nail-bitingly difficult works, including an hourlong piece played in complete darkness and a recent performance in which they labored with rubber restraints and elements of sensory deprivation. But even their straight-up renderings of thorny classics of the European avant-garde are as compulsively watchable as an episode of “American Ninja Warrior.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '47', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/0918Quartet1/0918Quartet1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 461, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/0918Quartet1/0918Quartet1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 461}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/0918Quartet1/0918Quartet1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 787, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/0918Quartet1/0918Quartet1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1573, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/0918Quartet1/0918Quartet1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/0918Quartet1/0918Quartet1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/0918Quartet1/0918Quartet1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Season for Reshuffled, Mature String Quartets', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Reshuffled and More Mature', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'da Fonseca-Wollheim, Corinna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Rider', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JACK Quartet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value':