newly acquired from the Bulls for the 2016-17 season, is scheduled to be in a Los Angeles courtroom as the defendant in a lawsuit when the Knicks’ play their first preseason game Oct. 4.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/16/sports/basketball/ny-knicks-derrick-rose-rape-lawsuit.html', 'snippet': 'Rose, newly acquired from the Bulls for the 2016-17 season, is scheduled to be in a Los Angeles courtroom as the defendant in a lawsuit when the Knicks’ play their first preseason game Oct. 4.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Derrick Rose was a dazzling point guard when he was named the N.B.A.’s most valuable player in 2011. Back then, he was viewed as the savior of the Bulls franchise, a native son who was going to bring Chicago its first N.B.A. title since the Michael Jordan era. He had what was considered generational talent, a contract worth nearly $100 million and a signature shoe made by Adidas.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/sports/16-Y-ROSE/16-Y-ROSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/16/sports/16-Y-ROSE/16-Y-ROSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/sports/16-Y-ROSE/16-Y-ROSE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/sports/16-Y-ROSE/16-Y-ROSE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/sports/16-Y-ROSE/16-Y-ROSE-thumbStandar