062e0d42bbab'}, {'abstract': 'Not everyone has the stomach for the moral high ground, or all that kale.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/18/magazine/judge-john-hodgman-on-meat-eaters-at-a-vegetarian-wedding.html', 'snippet': 'Not everyone has the stomach for the moral high ground, or all that kale.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hannah writes: My fiancé and I are vegetarians and have decided to have a vegetarian wedding. But I want to serve meat at the rehearsal dinner. My future in-laws would appreciate it, and they are paying for the dinner. My fiancé says that we should stay consistent if we want to take a moral and environmental stance. Please help!', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '38', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/magazine/18hodgman/18hodgman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 596, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/18/magazine/18hodgman/18hodgman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 596}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/magazine/18hodgman/18hodgman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1017, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/magazine/18hodgman/18hodgman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1273, 'width': 1282, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/magazine/18hodgman/18hodgman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/18/magazine/18hodgman/18hodgman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {