ks-chinas-u-n-seat/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: Secretary of State Dean Rusk announces that the U.S. will block China’s admission into the United Nations in September 1966.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Secretary of State Dean Rusk told a press conference today that the United States would again oppose Communist China’s admission into the United Nations when the General Assembly opens later this month. He thus confirmed authoritative reports last night that the Johnson administration, after a long review, had rejected the idea of a two-China policy. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/17/blogs/17oldiht-1966-china-UN/17oldiht-1966-china-UN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 547, 'width': 388, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/17/blogs/17oldiht-1966-china-UN/17oldiht-1966-china-UN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 547, 'width': 388, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/17/blogs/17oldiht-1966-china-UN/17oldiht-1966-china-UN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/17/blogs/17oldiht-1966-china-UN/17oldiht-1966-china-UN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/17/blogs/17oldiht-1966-china-UN/17oldiht-1966-china-UN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1966: U.S. Blocks China’s U.N. Seat', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker'