demonstrate the challenges facing market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The art and antiques market has undergone significant changes in the 21st century. Arguably the most dramatic of these is the hegemony of the new, and of the relatively new. Last year, postwar and contemporary art accounted for 46 percent of the world’s $63.8 billion of auction and dealer sales, according to the 2016 Tefaf Art Market Report that was published in March. Modern art generated a further 30 percent of sales, the report said, leaving the material culture of the preceding 5,000 years with less than a quarter of the market.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/17/arts/17iht-reyburn19-a/17iht-reyburn19-a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/17/arts/17iht-reyburn19-a/17iht-reyburn19-a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/17/arts/17iht-reyburn19-a/17iht-reyburn19-a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/17/arts/17iht-reyburn19-a/17iht-reyburn19-a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1192, 'width': 1860, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/17/arts/17iht-reyburn19-a/17iht-reyburn19-a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/17/arts/17iht-reyburn19-a/17iht-reyburn19-a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/17/arts/17iht-reyburn19-a/17iht-reyburn19-a-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris Art Fairs Strive to Get Back on Track', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conventions, Fairs and Trade Shows', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-16T16:53:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'International Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Reyburn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reyburn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/82b6067e-16af-5146-baf9-c7ff420eb811', 'word_count': 1145, 'uri': 'nyt://article/82b6067e-16af-5146-baf9-c7ff420eb811'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Dwan either represented, collected or sold the work of a cluster of important midcentury artists, almost all of them men.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/18/arts/design/virginia-dwan-a-jet-age-medici-gets-her-due.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Dwan either represented, collected or sold the work of a cluster of important midcentury artists, almost all of them men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Giving a tour of her art-filled apartment off Central Park, the dealer Virginia Dwan is all diffidence and grace. Dressed in elegant gray-on-gray, she speaks softly of her black-on-black abstraction by Ad Reinhardt, most meditative of Abstract Expressionists. She waxes quietly enthusiastic about a grid of copper floor tiles by the Minimalist Carl André. She shows off a series of clear plastic boxes by Charles Ross, a pioneer of Land Art whose work with prisms, she says, never got him the attention he deserves.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '100', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/18DWAN5/18DWAN5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/18DWAN5/18DWAN5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/18DWAN5/18DWAN5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/18DWAN5/18DWAN5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/18DWAN5/18DWAN5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/18DWAN5/18DWAN5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/arts/18DWAN5/18DWAN5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Virginia Dwan, a Jet Age Medici, Gets Her Due', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Jet Age Medici Gets Her Due', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Col