dia', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By THE NEW YORK TIMES', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/c585295f-f77f-5051-9910-454cf8ed02ae', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/c585295f-f77f-5051-9910-454cf8ed02ae'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. White’s two-hour magic spectacle plays Thursdays through Saturdays, and he finds time to practice on Sundays, and to relax with his fiancée.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/18/nyregion/how-dan-white-a-magician-spends-his-sundays.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. White’s two-hour magic spectacle plays Thursdays through Saturdays, and he finds time to practice on Sundays, and to relax with his fiancée.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How in the world did Dan White manage to levitate his assistant, dressed in a long white gown and surrounded on three sides by spectators, almost three feet in the air? Audiences may never know, but people continue to flock to “The Magician,” Mr. White’s old-school magic show featuring mind reading, far-from-ordinary card tricks, and other acts, Thursdays through Saturdays at the NoMad Hotel in the Flatiron district. On Sundays, Mr. White, 35, practices parts of his routine, but also uses the time to relax with his fiancée, Susie Bray. They live in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, with their toy poodle, Gracie.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/nyregion/18ROUTINE1/18ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 445, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/18/nyregion/18ROUTINE1/18ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 445}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/nyregion/18ROUTINE1