e': 'organizations', 'value': 'Museum at Eldridge Street', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Synagogues', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-16T19:37:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robin Pogrebin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogrebin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97567d58-4d8e-56ca-9c32-a0607c70b5db', 'word_count': 115, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97567d58-4d8e-56ca-9c32-a0607c70b5db'}, {'abstract': 'The celebrated photographer put together a group show of three of his former students’ works, which opens tomorrow at Sprüth Magers Berlin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/16/t-magazine/art/andreas-gursky-louisa-clement-anna-vogel-moritz-wegwerth.html', 'snippet': 'The celebrated photographer put together a group show of three of his former students’ works, which opens tomorrow at Sprüth Magers Berlin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andreas Gursky has long been the subject of exhibitions; since the German photographer and Kunstakademie Düsseldorf professor’s first solo outing in the late 1980s, his large-format images have been mounted in the Museum of Modern Art, Paris’s Centre Pompidou, the Museo Nacional Centro de Arte Reina Sofía in Madrid and the United Arab Emirates’ Sharjah Art Museum, to list a few. But this weekend, Gursky picks up the mantle of curator, with the opening of “Louisa Clement, Anna Vogel, Moritz Wegwerth,” featuring three of his former students, at Sprüth Magers Berlin. While he has organized the end-of-semester presentations (“Akademierundgänge”) at the academy, he has never coordinated a museum or gallery show until now. He says he gladly accepted the “special task,” explaining, “I am not curating artworks of students, but individual artistic personalities who pursue their artistic path with strong commitment.” Here, Clement, Vogel and Wegwerth discuss their practices — and their former teacher.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/t-magazine/16tmag-gursky1/16tmag-gursky1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/16/t-magazine/16tmag-gursky1/16tmag-gursky1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 441}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/t-magazine/16tmag-gursky1/16tmag-gursky1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 752, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/t-magazine/16tmag-gursky1/16tmag-gursky1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1504, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/t-magazine/16tmag-gursky1/16tmag-gursky1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/16/t-magazine/16tmag-gursky1/16tmag-gursky1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/16/t-magazine/16tmag-gursky1/16tmag-gursky1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Three Young Photography Stars, Tapped by Gursky', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-16T19:37:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Art', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilary Moss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fdc70ac6-542e-53d8-a74c-5d99291f3c3a', 'word_count': 595, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fdc70ac6-542e-53d8-a74c-5d99291f3c3a'}, {'abstract': 'Observations and scribbles from the margins of a fashion reporter’s notebook.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2016/09/16/fashion/memorable-moments-from-new-york-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'Observations and scribbles from the margins of a fashion reporter’s notebook.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Observations and scribbles from the margins of a fashion reporter’s notebook.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/fashion/18ROUNDUP8-WEB/18ROUNDUP8-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/18/fashion/18ROUNDUP8-WEB/18ROUNDUP8-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/fashion/18ROUNDUP8-WEB/18ROUNDUP8-WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/fashion/18ROUNDUP8-WEB/18ROUNDUP8-WEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1110, 'width': 1668, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'leg