bstract': 'The Pentagon on Friday stressed that about three dozen Special Operations troops would serve in an “advise and assist” capacity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/17/world/middleeast/us-troops-syria-isis.html', 'snippet': 'The Pentagon on Friday stressed that about three dozen Special Operations troops would serve in an “advise and assist” capacity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — American Special Operations forces have arrived in northern Syria to work alongside Turkish troops fighting the Islamic State, the Pentagon said on Friday, stressing that the approximately three dozen Americans would serve in an “advise and assist” capacity.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Special Operations Forces Arrive in Syria to Advise Turks in ISIS Fight', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Special Forces to Aid Turks Fighting ISIS in North Syria  ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Special Operations Command', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-16T19:38:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Helene Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Helene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4a