e, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/realestate/18HIGHEND4/18HIGHEND4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Transformation on Brooklyn’s Southern Shore', 'kicker': 'The High End', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On Brooklyn’s Waterfront', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Building (Construction)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sheepshead Bay (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Floods', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-16T19:38:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Barkan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barkan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e55221c2-4f4f-5f61-a9bb-5d03150f3f15', 'word_count': 857, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e55221c2-4f4f-5f61-a9bb-5d03150f3f15'}, {'abstract': 'Paul Jacobs, chairman of Juilliard’s organ department, performed a program of Liszt, Brahms and Julius Reubke on Wednesday evening in Paul Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/17/arts/music/almost-as-much-to-watch-as-to-hear-mighty-organ-pieces.html', 'snippet': 'Paul Jacobs, chairman of Juilliard’s organ department, performed a program of Liszt, Brahms and Julius Reubke on Wednesday evening in Paul Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With all the wonderful and distinctive organs New York has to offer, you might have wished that Paul Jacobs had played his recital on Wednesday evening on something other than the modest Holtkamp instrument in Paul Hall at the Juilliard School. The program,