dley, who has sung in New York’s subway system for decades and is the mother of the actress Gabourey Sidibe, is about to release her debut album.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alice Tan Ridley sat before the mirror in her Harlem apartment. She brushed on gold eye shadow, took an auburn wig off a mannequin’s head and put it on. “I really, really don’t know what I’m doing,” she said, laughing. “I never used to wear makeup at all. And I never wore wigs. I just braided my hair in teeny braids that would hang when I’d get wet.”', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Years Underground, a Subway Singer Gets the Spotlight', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Subway Singer in the Spotlight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ridley, Alice Tan (1952- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hartman, Susan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Street Performers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': "America's Got Talent (TV Program)", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-16T21:16:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metropolitan', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Hartman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hartman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7a2f2e8b-bf5f-5516-ab93-211cf54c1497', 'word_count': 2484, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7a2f2e8b-bf5f-5516-ab93-211cf54c1497'}, {'abstract': 'Our favorite looks from the people at this season’s shows.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2016/09/18/fashion/best-of-stree