d leading up to the New York Fashion Week runway.', 'lead_paragraph': '“We are really late,” said Katie Grand, the stylist and adviser behind Marc Jacobs’s biannual women’s wear shows. “Everyone says that every season, but this is especially, especially late.” To underline the point, it was a little more than 48 hours before Jacobs’s spring/summer 2017 runway, yet very little of the collection was hanging on the rails of Jacobs’s Spring Street studio. Jacobs himself was on his knees on the floor, chopping into a printed chiffon dress. A few boxes held towering platform boots in a fistful of gummy bear colors. There wasn’t much else around.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '48 Hours Before the Marc Jacobs Show, With Katie Grand', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Marc Jacobs International LLC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-16T21:37:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexander Fury', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexander', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fury', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/524d63d6-2cb4-575f-922b-72c2b0d49136', 'word_count': 669, 'uri': 'nyt://article/524d63d6-2cb4-575f-922b-72c2b0d49136'}, {'abstract': 'A weekly roundup of news and events with a focus on the True North.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/17/world/canada/canada-today.html', 'snippet': 'A weekly roundup of news and events with a focus on the True North.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We’re trying something ne