n Amagansett, N.Y.', 'lead_paragraph': 'J Z Holden and Jules Feiffer are to be married on Sept. 18 at the home of Judith Hudson, a friend of the couple in Amagansett, N.Y. Mary Faith Westervelt, a town justice for Shelter Island, N.Y., is to officiate at a ceremony that will combine Jewish and Buddhist traditions and will be led by Monte Farber, a friend of the bride who is also a Universal Life minister.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/fashion/weddings/18HOLDEN/18HOLDEN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 483, 'width': 461, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/fashion/weddings/18HOLDEN/18HOLDEN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 483, 'width': 461, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/fashion/weddings/18HOLDEN/18HOLDEN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/18/fashion/weddings/18HOLDEN/18HOLDEN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/fashion/weddings/18HOLDEN/18HOLDEN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'JZ Holden and Jules Feiffer: Humor and Truth Spark Outrage, Then a Union', 'kicker': 'JZ Holden, Jules Feiffer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Humor and Truth Comes Love', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Feiffer, Jules', 'rank': 1, 'ma