6cbab-ac0a-582d-b9c4-1a3172495249'}, {'abstract': 'The Patriots, the Steelers and the Giants survived sloppy Week 2 battles. Here’s what happened around the league.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/18/sports/nfl-scores-schedule.html', 'snippet': 'The Patriots, the Steelers and the Giants survived sloppy Week 2 battles. Here’s what happened around the league.', 'lead_paragraph': '■ Optimism is easy to come by in the offseason, but maintaining it in the regular season for even two games can be far more difficult. Just ask the Jaguars (0-2), the Raiders (1-1, with 69 points allowed through two games) and the Buccaneers (1-1 after being crushed 40-7 by the Cardinals).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/sports/nflbriefing-diggs/nflbriefing-diggs-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 496, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/20/sports/nflbriefing-diggs/nflbriefing-diggs-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 496}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/sports/nflbriefing-diggs/nflbriefing-diggs-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 847, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/sports/nflbriefing-diggs/nflbriefing-diggs-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1694, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/sports/nflbriefing-diggs/nflbriefing-diggs-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/20/sports/nflbriefing-diggs/nflbriefing-diggs-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/sports/nflbriefing-diggs/nflbriefing-diggs-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'N.F.L.: Here’s What We Learned in Week 2', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cowboys’ Rookie Quarterback Wins With a Veteran’s Poise', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-18T15:35:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2d03af1d-a881-5b13-85d7-dab10abe5ff6', 'word_count': 2080, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d03af1d-a881-5b13-85d7-dab10abe5ff6'}, {'abstract': 'For spring/summer 2017, the hairstylist Duffy wound models’ hair around chopstick-thin curling irons — but had a trick to avoid “instant noodle hair.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/18/t-magazine/fashion/topshop-unique-beauty-london-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'For spring/summer 2017, the hairstylist Duffy wound models’ hair around chopstick-thin curling irons — but had a trick to avoid “instant noodle hair.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The ravishing beauty of 1980s supermodels was the powerful starting point for the saturated Rapunzel curls backstage at Topshop Unique for spring/summer 2017. “We were going to go quite extreme with a ponytail,” explained the hairstylist Duffy. “But it felt too young, so we’ve gone for a more mature style.” Overloading the hair with L’Oreal Professional’s PHI to create a matte finish, Duffy blasted it with the dryer (no brushing required), pulling it into a topknot tied together with “any old elastic,” before piling on lashings of Volume Life Mousse. After allowing the hair to set, he carefully twisted and twirled small sections around a curling iron with the dimensions of a chopstick. The real power move was to stop short of what Duffy termed “instant noodle hair,” by literally clapping the curls between the palms of the hands to break them up, for a more modern, lived-in look. Once complete, the elastic was snipped out and the hair swept over either to the left or the right of models’ heads, in what amounted to a hair homage to a young Cindy Crawford.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/t-magazine/fashion/18tmag-bbr-01/18tmag-bbr-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/18/t-magazine/fashion/18tmag-bbr-01/18tmag-bbr-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/t-magazine/fashion/18tmag-bbr-01/18tmag-bbr-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/t-magazine/fashion/18tmag-bbr-01/18tmag-bbr-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1367, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/t-magazine/fashion/18tmag-bbr-01/18tmag-bbr-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/18/t-magazine/fashion/18tmag-bbr-01/18tmag-bbr-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/18/t-magazine/fashion/18tmag-bbr-01/18tmag-bbr-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At Topshop Unique, an ’80s Supermodel Curl', 'kicker': 'Backstage Beauty Report', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hair', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crawford, Cindy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-18T15:45:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aimee Farrell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aimee', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Farrell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72dbf771-abb1-5b37-a868-911bfef4a956', 'word_count': 183, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72dbf771-abb1-5b37-a868-911bfef4a956'}, {'abstract': 'Peter Pilotto and Christopher De Vos show their spring designs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2016/09/18/fashion/runway-womens/peter-pilotto-spring-2017.html', 'snippet': 'Peter Pilotto and Christopher De Vos show their spring designs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Peter Pilotto and Christopher De Vos show their spring designs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u