 playoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shortly after the Mets said Saturday that Jacob deGrom would in all probability miss the remainder of the season, Manager Terry Collins had to announce a replacement starter for Sunday’s game.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/19/sports/19METSweb/19METSweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/19/sports/19METSweb/19METSweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/19/sports/19METSweb/19METSweb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/19/sports/19METSweb/19METSweb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1431, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/19/sports/19METSweb/19METSweb-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/19/sports/19METSweb/19METSweb-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/19/sports/19METSweb/19METSweb-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Who’s the New Guy Pitching for the Mets? Doesn’t Matter. They Keep Winning.', 'kicker': 'Mets 3, Twins 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Who’s Pitching for Mets? No Matter. They Win.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berkman, Seth', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALDERSON, SANDY', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minnesota Twins', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Conforto, Michael', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ynoa, Gabriel (1993- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-18T20:54:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Seth Berkman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Seth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berkman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d81043b0-fb95-5b9b-97ff-cb60f80d359b', 'word_count': 874, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d81043b0-fb95-5b9b-97ff-cb60f80d359b'}, {'abstract': 'The quick response to Saturday night’s explosion in Manhattan reflects the vigilance and public calm that are needed in today’s dangerous world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/19/opinion/reason-and-vigilance-after-the-blast.html', 'snippet': 'The quick response to Saturday night’s explosion in Manhattan reflects the vigilance and public calm that are needed in today’s dangerous world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A blast on a warm Saturday night in Manhattan sent people running through the streets. More than two dozen were hurt. New York City, accustomed to living with the echo and shadow of terrorism, handled the shock with composure.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'