d on the same day a prohibition on the sale of confectionery will go into effect. The five-point program forbids the serving of antipasto or double portions of any dishes. No soups made with eggs may be served, which bans the popular ‘‘zuppa pavese,’’ made by poaching an egg or two in meat broth. No butter, olive oil or other fats may be served separately from the dishes of which they may be an element. — New York Herald Tribune, Sept. 20, 1941', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/blogs/20oldiht-1941-antipasto/20oldiht-1941-antipasto-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/20/blogs/20oldiht-1941-antipasto/20oldiht-1941-antipasto-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/blogs/20oldiht-1941-antipasto/20oldiht-1941-antipasto-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/blogs/20oldiht-1941-antipasto/20oldiht-1941-antipasto-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 229, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/20/blogs/20oldiht-1941-antipasto/20oldiht-1941-antipasto-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 229}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/blogs/20oldiht-1941-antipasto/20oldiht-1941-antipasto-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 959, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/b