 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd519541-fbe3-57a1-b25c-e3451f1720aa'}, {'abstract': 'Governments must create the conditions to encourage private investment in clean technologies and sustainable development.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/20/opinion/how-to-raise-trillions-for-green-investments.html', 'snippet': 'Governments must create the conditions to encourage private investment in clean technologies and sustainable development.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAVING our planet from the worst effects of climate change won’t be cheap. A new report from the United Nations says that the world will need to mobilize $90 trillion in public and private capital over the next 15 years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/opinion/20paulson/20paulson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/20/opinion/20paulson/20paulson-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/opinion/20paulson/20paulson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/opinion/20paulson/20paulson-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1151, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/20/opinion/20paulson/20paulson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/20/opinion/20paulson/20paulson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheigh