.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/21/nyregion/ahmad-khan-rahamis-youtube-account-included-jihad-videos-complaint-says.html', 'snippet': 'Two of the 96 videos listed under his favorites were related to jihad, while the others included romantic ballads and do-it-yourself videos.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The man who the police say planted bombs in New York and New Jersey had a YouTube account that listed his favorite videos, two of which related to jihad, according to a criminal complaint filed in Federal District Court in New York on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ahmad Khan Rahami’s YouTube Account Listed Jihad Videos, Complaint Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chelsea, Manhattan Bombing (2016)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rahimi, Ahmad Khan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-21T02:09:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Mele', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mele', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5903163-1564-59a3-ab64-7989747742f8', 'word_count': 291, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5903163-1564-59a3-ab64-7989747742f8'}, {'abstract': 'When Mr. Trump, a close adviser to his father, likened Syrian refugees to deadly Skittles, it was not the first time he had been accused of poor taste.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/21/us/politics/donald-trump-jr-skittles.html', 'snippet': 'When Mr. Trump, a close adviser to his father, likened Syrian refugees to deadly Skittles, it was not the first time he had been accused of poor taste.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald Trump Jr. — a close political adviser to his father, Donald J. Trump, the Republican nominee for president — posted on Twitter on Monday night an image of a white bowl full of rainbow-colored Skittles. The image came with this text: “If I had a bowl of skittles and I told you just three would kill you. Would you take a handful? That’s our Syrian refugee problem.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/21/us/21DONJUNIOR1/21DONJUNIOR1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/21/us/21DONJUNIOR1/21DONJUNIOR1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/21/us/21DONJUNIOR1/21DONJUNIOR1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/21/us/21DONJUNIOR1/21DONJUNIOR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/21/us/21DONJUNIOR1/21DONJUNIOR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/21/us/21DONJUNIOR1/21DONJUNIOR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/21/us/21DONJUNIOR1/21DONJUNIOR1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 20