e3408231', 'word_count': 980, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4449e4d-2acd-58ae-92a7-9114e3408231'}, {'abstract': '“Kurios: Cabinet of Curiosities” will play under a big top in a pop-up space.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/25/theater/cirque-du-soleil-brings-steampunk-to-randalls-island.html', 'snippet': '“Kurios: Cabinet of Curiosities” will play under a big top in a pop-up space.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cirque du Soleil has its geographical bases pretty much covered, from “Paramour,” currently on Broadway, to the many productions in Las Vegas and on tour. But the best way to experience the circus is under a big top, which makes “Kurios: Cabinet of Curiosities,” to be presented in a pop-up space on Randalls Island, especially exciting. And it arrives in New York with exuberant reviews in its wake: “It is not to be missed on any account,” Chris Jones wrote in The Chicago Tribune.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/arts/25GUIDE7/25GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/25/arts/25GUIDE7/25GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/arts/25GUIDE7/25GUIDE7-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/arts/25GUIDE7/25GUIDE7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 459, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/25/arts/25GUIDE7/25GUIDE7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 459}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption