'uri': 'nyt://article/7cab79db-0015-5a7e-b77b-20c6f8c6d670'}, {'abstract': 'Charlotte’s police chief stood by his decision not to release the recordings. As people resumed protests Thursday night, the city’s mayor ordered a curfew.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/23/us/charlotte-protests-keith-scott.html', 'snippet': 'Charlotte’s police chief stood by his decision not to release the recordings. As people resumed protests Thursday night, the city’s mayor ordered a curfew.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. — The grieving relatives of a man who was killed by the police here watched videos on Thursday of the fatal shooting, a wrenching experience that they said revealed no hint of aggression in him and left the family members convinced that the videos should be made public. But the city’s police chief, who had arranged for the private viewing, held fast to his decision not to release the recordings.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Keith Scott’s Family Sees Videos of His Killing, and Says the Public Should, Too', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dead Man’s Family Sees Videos and Says Public Should, Too', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Charlotte (NC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Keith Lamont (1973-2016)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roberts, Jennifer W', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-22T1