vice).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/25/nyregion/shove-over-i-want-back-on-the-grid.html', 'snippet': 'A visit to a rustic country cabin makes one long for the city’s chaos (and the phone service).', 'lead_paragraph': 'The three words that terrify me most are “off the grid,” so it’s a testament to our friendship that I visit my pal Joyce (yeah, same name) in her off-the-grid cabin in the Catskills every summer.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25MISINFORMED/25MISINFORMED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25MISINFORMED/25MISINFORMED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25MISINFORMED/25MISINFORMED-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25MISINFORMED/25MISINFORMED-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25MISINFORMED/25MISINFORMED-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 452}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25MISINFORMED/25MISINFORMED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25MISINFORMED/25MISINFORMED-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1542, 'width':