uri': 'nyt://article/75e0897b-e3be-5411-8ed1-bb09aeaa4ee5'}, {'abstract': 'Kim Jee-woon’s new action movie takes place in Korea in the 1920s, when the country was under Japanese occupation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/23/movies/the-age-of-shadows-review.html', 'snippet': 'Kim Jee-woon’s new action movie takes place in Korea in the 1920s, when the country was under Japanese occupation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like a reader skimming a novel to find the juicy parts, Kim Jee-woon gets through the story dutifully enough in “The Age of Shadows.” But this director is really looking to stage the action sequences, which he prolongs and savors once they arrive.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/23/arts/23AGEOFSHADOWS/23AGEOFSHADOWS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/23/arts/23AGEOFSHADOWS/23AGEOFSHADOWS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/23/arts/23AGEOFSHADOWS/23AGEOFSHADOWS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 766, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/23/arts/23AGEOFSHADOWS/23AGEOFSHADOWS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1473, 'width': 1970, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/23/arts/23AGEOFSHADOWS/23AGEOFSHADOWS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/23/arts/23AGEOFSHADOWS/23AGEOFSHADOWS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thum