w-jean-grae-an-actress-and-musician-spends-her-sundays.html', 'snippet': 'For Ms. Grae, Sundays are about watching TV, cooking brunch, going to thrift and vintage stores, and meeting up with friends.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jean Grae, born Tsidi Ibrahim, made a name for herself as an underground M.C. alongside friends and fellow hip-hop artists like Talib Kweli in the 1990s. She later produced and starred in the comedic online series “Life With Jeannie.” On Oct. 2, she will host the Golden Probes, a satirical ceremony that will pay tribute to “outstanding achievements in the fields of sexism and anti-abortion extremism.” The show will also feature the comedians Sarah Silverman and Abbi Jacobson and Ilana Glazer from the TV series “Broad City.” Ms. Grae, 39, lives in Bushwick, Brooklyn, with Quelle Chris, a musician and producer. The two recently broke up, and Mr. Chris is looking for a new apartment.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25ROUTINE1/25ROUTINE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25ROUTINE1/25ROUTINE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25ROUTINE1/25ROUTINE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25ROUTINE1/25ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 469, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/25/nyregion/25ROUTINE1/25ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeh