 'uri': 'nyt://article/74921118-b7f3-5c3d-b791-e97dc98ecd92'}, {'abstract': 'Most of the deaths were inflicted by a Saudi-led coalition that supports Yemen’s president, but some blame also was placed on Houthi rebels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/24/world/middleeast/over-300-civilians-have-been-killed-in-yemen-since-august-un-says.html', 'snippet': 'Most of the deaths were inflicted by a Saudi-led coalition that supports Yemen’s president, but some blame also was placed on Houthi rebels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — United Nations human rights officials expressed alarm on Friday at a sharp rise in civilian casualties in Yemen since peace talks collapsed last month, the great majority of them inflicted in airstrikes by a coalition led by Saudi Arabia.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rising Toll on Civilians in Yemen Raises Alarm', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rising Toll on Civilians in Yemen Raises Alarm', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yemen', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cumming-Bruce, Nick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hadi, Abdu Rabbu Mansour', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saudi Arabia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-23T16:39:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Cumming-Bruce', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cumming-Bruce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://ar