ion/sunday/where-to-go-from-the-anger-in-charlotte.html', 'snippet': 'I served as a police chief for 17 years and have never seen such a challenging environment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Charlotte, N.C. — On Wednesday, I spent the day here teaching a workshop for senior police leaders from around the country — deputies and sheriffs who are one step away from taking control of police departments of their own. That night, I went back to the Omni Charlotte Hotel. From my window, I could see lines of police officers assembled, and I could see protesters throwing various objects. I watched the officers release tear gas into the crowd.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/opinion/sunday/25ramsey/25ramsey-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/25/opinion/sunday/25ramsey/25ramsey-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/opinion/sunday/25ramsey/25ramsey-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/opinion/sunday/25ramsey/25ramsey-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1335, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/opinion/sunday/25ramsey/25ramsey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/25/opinion/sunday/25ramsey/25ramsey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0