mington, N.C., was married Sept. 24 to Scott Huang, the son of Joanne Huang and Chih Hsueh Huang of Great Neck, N.Y. Nicholas J. Mora, a college friend of the couple, became a minister of the American Marriage Ministries to preside; he officiated at the Princeton University Chapel in Princeton, N.J.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rui Cheng, Scott Huang', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rui Cheng,  Scott Huang', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-25T04:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b79743d-e80a-59c5-a399-56bd6b89abc2', 'word_count': 175, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b79743d-e80a-59c5-a399-56bd6b89abc2'}, {'abstract': 'The couple, who met at the University of Virginia, were married at the Bryant Park Grill in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/25/fashion/weddings/logan-mcclellan-robert-eshleman.html', 'snippet': 'The couple, who met at the University of Virginia, were married at the Bryant Park Grill in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Logan Michael McClellan, the son of Julia A. McClellan and Michael L. McClellan of Chesapeake, Va., was married Sept. 24 to Charles Robert Eshleman, the son of Elizabeth A. Boh and Charles L. Eshleman III, both of New Orleans, and the stepson of Helen F. Eshleman. Shane L. Regier, a friend of the couple who became a Universal Life minister for the occasion, officiated at the Bryant Park Grill in New York.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',