uple met at Hamilton College, from which they both graduated, he cum laude.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amy Lauren Goldstein, the daughter of Ellen Keats and Irv J. Goldstein of Greenwich, Conn., was married Sept. 24 to Jonathan David Farber, a son of Deborah G. Farber and Judge Sidney T. Farber of Penfield, N.Y. Rabbi Vicki Axe officiated at the Belle Haven Club in Greenwich.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/fashion/weddings/25GOLDSTEIN/25GOLDSTEIN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/25/fashion/weddings/25GOLDSTEIN/25GOLDSTEIN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/fashion/weddings/25GOLDSTEIN/25GOLDSTEIN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 605, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/fashion/weddings/25GOLDSTEIN/25GOLDSTEIN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 1231, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/fashion/weddings/25GOLDSTEIN/25GOLDSTEIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/25/fashion/weddings/25GOLDSTEIN/25GOLDSTEIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/25/fashion/weddings/25GOLDSTEIN/25GOLDSTEIN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 