d', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60842b36-b75d-5a61-bb41-7d96f4ec89cf', 'word_count': 1865, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60842b36-b75d-5a61-bb41-7d96f4ec89cf'}, {'abstract': 'The governors of New York and New Jersey were once praised for rooting out corruption. Now, both have seen former close aides accused of misdeeds.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/26/nyregion/for-cuomo-and-christie-parallel-paths-to-the-top-and-trouble-when-they-got-there.html', 'snippet': 'The governors of New York and New Jersey were once praised for rooting out corruption. Now, both have seen former close aides accused of misdeeds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It might be hard to remember now, with one governor embroiled in a corruption scandal for the last three years and his counterpart across the Hudson River plunging headlong into another, but Chris Christie of New Jersey and Andrew M. Cuomo of New York were once lionized for relentlessly prosecuting bad behavior in government.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/26/nyregion/26GOVS-hp/26GOVS-hp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/26/nyregion/26GOVS-hp/26GOVS-hp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/26/nyregion/26GOVS-hp/26GOVS-hp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/26/nyregion/26GOVS-hp/26GOVS-hp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'r