sible and a little bit more in the public interest.’’ Before arriving to speak on behalf of Democratic candidates in the November election, Mr. Humphrey always had attempted to submerge any friction with the Kennedy camp. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Sept. 27, 1966', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/blogs/27oldiht-1966-humphrey/27oldiht-1966-humphrey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/27/blogs/27oldiht-1966-humphrey/27oldiht-1966-humphrey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/blogs/27oldiht-1966-humphrey/27oldiht-1966-humphrey-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/blogs/27oldiht-1966-humphrey/27oldiht-1966-humphrey-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/27/blogs/27oldiht-1966-humphrey/27oldiht-1966-humphrey-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/blogs/27oldiht-1966-humphrey/27oldiht-1966-humphrey-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 603, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/blogs/27oldiht-1966-humphrey/27oldiht-1966-humphrey-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 603, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'