till crushing homers at age 40. But his remarkable season is a definitive goodbye.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/27/sports/baseball/david-ortiz-retire-boston-red-sox.html', 'snippet': 'The slugger who helped lift the cloud over the Red Sox is still crushing homers at age 40. But his remarkable season is a definitive goodbye.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Oct. 1, 1986, at the old Arlington Stadium in Texas, Dave Kingman hit his 35th home run of the season for the Oakland Athletics. About 7,000 fans were there to see it. Kingman finished the season hitting .210 and never played in the majors again.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/sports/27ORTIZtest1/27ORTIZtest1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 857, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/27/sports/27ORTIZtest1/27ORTIZtest1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 857}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/sports/27ORTIZtest1/27ORTIZtest1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 718, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/sports/27ORTIZtest1/27ORTIZtest1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1435, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/sports/27ORTIZtest1/27ORTIZtest1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/27/sports/27ORTIZtest1/27ORTIZtest1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLa