act-checked Hillary Clinton and Donald J. Trump on the economy, trade and other issues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/27/us/politics/fact-check-debate.html', 'snippet': 'Our team of reporters fact-checked Hillary Clinton and Donald J. Trump on the economy, trade and other issues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hillary Clinton and Donald J. Trump kept fact-checkers busy throughout their first debate on Monday night as they sparred over their policies and records on the economy, national security, the environment and their personal pasts. In keeping with how he has run his campaign, Mr. Trump stretched the facts more often than Mrs. Clinton did; a couple of times, Mrs. Clinton literally called out for fact-checkers from the stage. (Here’s how we analyzed it live, and  the highlights.)', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Our Fact Checks of the First Debate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Assessing the Candidates’ Claims on Foreign Policy and the Economy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Political)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Savage, Charlie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Irwin, Neil', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Appelbaum, Binyamin', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-27T01:21:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d120249a-62d2-5a15-