 [{'firstname': 'Jeremy', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Peters', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/003733eb-13c9-5277-8d39-009b8e1290d8', 'word_count': 909, 'uri': 'nyt://article/003733eb-13c9-5277-8d39-009b8e1290d8'}, {'abstract': 'In the heat of a playoff race, the Mets understood the added importance of their role in facing the Miami Marlins a day after the death of the star pitcher Jose Fernandez.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/27/sports/baseball/new-york-mets-miami-marlins.html', 'snippet': 'In the heat of a playoff race, the Mets understood the added importance of their role in facing the Miami Marlins a day after the death of the star pitcher Jose Fernandez.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — No matter how hard the Mets tried on Monday night, the emotions that overtook Marlins Park were so raw and profound that even they struggled. Jose Fernandez was not their teammate, but he was a young, vibrant and talented pitcher whom the Mets admired from afar and who sparked their own competitive fire.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/sports/27metsweb-1/27metsweb-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/27/sports/27metsweb-1/27metsweb-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/sports/27metsweb-1/27metsweb-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/27/sports/27metsweb-1/27metsweb-1-articleLarge.jpg