/article/7ff65f4e-c78f-594d-a4c7-49c9f96643fc', 'word_count': 271, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ff65f4e-c78f-594d-a4c7-49c9f96643fc'}, {'abstract': 'The artistic director doesn’t use soap in the morning and matches her makeup to her mood.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/29/fashion/julie-de-libran-shares-her-french-beauty-secrets.html', 'snippet': 'The artistic director doesn’t use soap in the morning and matches her makeup to her mood.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Julie de Libran, the artistic director for Sonia Rykiel, has a knack for knowing what the cool girls want. Her designs have been quite the hit with the international set, an aesthetic that may have been informed by her transcontinental upbringing. Ms. de Libran, 44, was born in Aix-en-Provence, France, but moved to the United States when she was 8. She now lives in Paris. Below, she shares the beauty products and services she will be relying on before the Rykiel spring 2017 show on Oct. 3.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29SKIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 802, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29SKIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 802}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29SKIN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 767, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29SKIN1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1534, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/