 included a premiere by Elizabeth Streb and a charismatic performance by the flamenco dancer Farruquito.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As millions of people tuned into the presidential debate on Monday, at least a couple of thousand opted out, flocking to City Center for the opening night of Fall for Dance. Tickets always go fast for this annual dance sampler, where every seat is just $15 (remember when they were $10, though?) and every program promises an assortment of styles rarely seen on one stage.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/arts/28FALLFORDANCE2/28FALLFORDANCE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/28/arts/28FALLFORDANCE2/28FALLFORDANCE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/arts/28FALLFORDANCE2/28FALLFORDANCE2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/arts/28FALLFORDANCE2/28FALLFORDANCE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/28/arts/28FALLFORDANCE2/28FALLFORDANCE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/arts/28FALLFORDANCE2/28FALLFORDANCE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/arts/28FALL