rd game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — The news was so routine for these Mets that it barely registered. Steven Matz, the fragile rookie who made three starts on last fall’s postseason joy ride, was officially shut down for the season Tuesday because of his sore left shoulder. As long as he is not pitching, the Mets said, Matz will finally get those bone spurs removed from his elbow next week.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/sports/28KEPNER/28KEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/28/sports/28KEPNER/28KEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/sports/28KEPNER/28KEPNER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/sports/28KEPNER/28KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 313, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/28/sports/28KEPNER/28KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 313}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/sports/28KEPNER/28KEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 534, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/sports/28KEPNER/28KEPNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1067, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets Still Scrambling f