 in Havana, to fill the post.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/28/us/politics/cuba-us-ambassador.html', 'snippet': 'The president selected Jeffrey DeLaurentis, who has served since 2014 as the chief of mission for the United States in Havana, to fill the post.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama on Tuesday nominated the first United States ambassador to Cuba in more than a half-century, defying opponents of his policy of rapprochement with the government of President Raúl Castro in an effort to further cement a new relationship between the countries before he leaves office.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/world/SUB-28AMBASSADOR/SUB-28AMBASSADOR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 634, 'width': 456, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/world/SUB-28AMBASSADOR/SUB-28AMBASSADOR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 634, 'width': 456, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/world/SUB-28AMBASSADOR/SUB-28AMBASSADOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/28/world/SUB-28AMBASSADOR/SUB-28AMBASSADOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/world/SUB-28AMBASSADOR/SUB-28AMBASSADOR-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Nominates First Ambassador to Cuba in Over 50 Years', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None