it could expose the American government, citizens and corporations to lawsuits abroad.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/28/opinion/the-risks-of-suing-the-saudis-for-9-11.html', 'snippet': 'While the aim of a bill is compassionate, it could expose the American government, citizens and corporations to lawsuits abroad.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Senate and the House are expected to vote this week on whether to override President Obama’s veto of a bill that would allow families of the victims of the Sept. 11 attacks to sue Saudi Arabia for any role it had in the terrorist operations. The lawmakers should let the veto stand.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/opinion/28wed2/28wed2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 571, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/28/opinion/28wed2/28wed2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 571}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/opinion/28wed2/28wed2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 975, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/opinion/28wed2/28wed2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1262, 'width': 1325, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/opinion/28wed2/28wed2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/28/opinion/28wed2/28wed2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '