'By Kwame Anthony Appiah', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kwame', 'middlename': 'Anthony', 'lastname': 'Appiah', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/711ecc0e-48cd-58c8-af5f-ccfd918d35df', 'word_count': 1173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/711ecc0e-48cd-58c8-af5f-ccfd918d35df'}, {'abstract': 'Is the five-second rule something you’ve invoked? Does the article change your mind in any way?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/28/learning/what-rules-do-you-have-for-staying-healthy.html', 'snippet': 'Is the five-second rule something you’ve invoked? Does the article change your mind in any way?', 'lead_paragraph': 'We all have ways we try to stay healthy, whether we learned them from our parents or picked them up on our own. Perhaps we always wash our hands before we eat — or take vitamins every morning, or never go outside in the cold with wet hair.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/us/00xp-fivesecondrule/00xp-fivesecondrule-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/14/us/00xp-fivesecondrule/00xp-fivesecondrule-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/us/00xp-fivesecondrule/00xp-fivesecondrule-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/14/us/00xp-fivesecondrule/00xp-fivesecondrule-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credi