ml', 'snippet': 'He grew up in England, but this veteran troubadour has a long history with the five boroughs. Now he’s back.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elvis Costello first saw Manhattan when he was 23. This was late 1977. He and his band, the Attractions, were coming down from New Haven on their first tour of the United States when the skyscrapers came into view.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102Cover1/102Cover1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102Cover1/102Cover1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102Cover1/102Cover1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102Cover1/102Cover1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102Cover1/102Cover1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102Cover1/102Cover1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102Cover1/102Cover1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1510, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Elvis Costello’s New York Soul', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'His New York Soul', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Costello, Elvis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Town Hall (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beacon Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Imposters, The (Music Group)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Attractions, The (Music Group)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Imperial Bedroom (Album)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pop and Rock Music', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-28T09:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Wendell Jamieson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Wendell', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jamieson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/798f1775-eb5e-533f-91a5-5133ec511b64', 'word_count': 2100, 'uri': 'nyt://article/798f1775-eb5e-533f-91a5-5133ec511b64'}, {'abstract': 'Advisers plan to more rigorously prepare him for his next debate with Hillary Clinton, but whether he is open to meticulous preparation is a major concern.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/29/us/politics/donald-trump-debate.html', 'snippet': 'Advisers plan to more rigorously prepare him for his next debate with Hillary Clinton, but whether he is open to meticulous preparation is a major concern.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Campaign advisers to Donald J. Trump, concerned that his focus and objectives had dissolved during the first presidential debate on Monday, plan to