f_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/660e1d20-e35e-5732-b885-1184f6b989ed', 'word_count': 177, 'uri': 'nyt://article/660e1d20-e35e-5732-b885-1184f6b989ed'}, {'abstract': 'By happy accident, the veteran actor Denis Arndt makes his Broadway debut in Simon Stephens’s “Heisenberg.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/02/theater/denis-arndt-mary-louise-parker-heisenberg.html', 'snippet': 'By happy accident, the veteran actor Denis Arndt makes his Broadway debut in Simon Stephens’s “Heisenberg.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a recent late-summer morning, the actor Denis Arndt sat down to a pint of Guinness and a plate of bivalves in the oyster bar at Grand Central Terminal. The beer was cool, the oysters plump, and Mr. Arndt had even put on a tie, a swirling print designed by Jerry Garcia. Normally he dresses up only for “openings and bat mitzvahs,” he said. But he was determined to make an occasion of this snack. And why not?', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102ARNDT1/102ARNDT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102ARNDT1/102ARNDT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102ARNDT1/102ARNDT1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102ARNDT1/102ARNDT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/02/arts/102ARNDT1/102ARNDT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xla