logical, aesthetic, psychological or simply circumstantial — but it has specific meaning in 2016. The relentlessness of modern internet conversation has led to an implicit threat: Be everywhere, or don’t be at all.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/arts/29BONIVER/29BONIVER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/29/arts/29BONIVER/29BONIVER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/arts/29BONIVER/29BONIVER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/arts/29BONIVER/29BONIVER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 498, 'width': 498, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/arts/29BONIVER/29BONIVER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 498, 'width': 498, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: With ‘22, a Million,’ Bon Iver Beats a Retreat to Even Quieter Reinvention', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Beating a Retreat to Reinvention,  Only to Return Smaller Than Before', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bon Iver (Music Group)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vernon, Justin (1981- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': '22, A Million (Album)', 'r