'_id': 'nyt://article/7333c30b-8fde-5b5b-acbb-4d83a980bfcc', 'word_count': 857, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7333c30b-8fde-5b5b-acbb-4d83a980bfcc'}, {'abstract': 'The future of the main opposition party’s leader, Pedro Sánchez, still hangs in the balance, after top party officials said they would resign in protest.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/29/world/europe/spain-socialists-politics.html', 'snippet': 'The future of the main opposition party’s leader, Pedro Sánchez, still hangs in the balance, after top party officials said they would resign in protest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MADRID — The leader of Spain’s main opposition Socialist Party on Wednesday narrowly escaped an attempt by senior members of his own party to oust him, after a string of electoral defeats and amid a lengthy stalemate in Spanish politics.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/world/29SPAIN/29SPAIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/29/world/29SPAIN/29SPAIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/world/29SPAIN/29SPAIN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/world/29SPAIN/29SPAIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 832, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/29/world/29SPAIN/29SPAIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 832}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/worl