ws', '_id': 'nyt://article/10ded227-e5e1-5da6-9fe0-152e3c68ecd4', 'word_count': 245, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10ded227-e5e1-5da6-9fe0-152e3c68ecd4'}, {'abstract': 'Peter Berg’s film dramatizes a familiar story and stands as a work of popular narrative for an age of corporate impunity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/30/movies/deepwater-horizon-review-mark-wahlberg.html', 'snippet': 'Peter Berg’s film dramatizes a familiar story and stands as a work of popular narrative for an age of corporate impunity.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Deepwater Horizon” is a swift and suspenseful action movie, full of noise, peril, muck and fire. It’s also a true-crime story, the highly detailed procedural chronicle of how, on April 20, 2010, 11 people were killed and a vast marine ecosystem was despoiled because of negligence and greed. Like “The Big Short,” this film, directed by Peter Berg, dramatizes a broadly familiar story and stands as a work of popular narrative for an age of corporate impunity. The anger and grief you feel leaving the theater constitute a kind of catharsis, a modest symbolic compensation for the failure of justice in the real world.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DEEPWATER/30DEEPWATER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DEEPWATER/30DEEPWATER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DEEPWATER/30DEEPWATER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DEEPWATER/30DEEPWATER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DEEPWATER/30DEEPWATER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DEEPWATER/30DEEPWATER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DEEPWATER/30DEEPWATER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1320, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘Deepwater Horizon,’ Oil, Fire and Greed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Oil, Fire and Greed at Sea', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berg, Peter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hudson, Kate (1979- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaluza, Robert', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Malkovich, John', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wahlberg, Mark', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Deepwater Horizon (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-29T11:00:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/6703dd63-041f-59a5-a7e1-25b7ccf0fcb5', 'word_count': 694, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6703dd63-041f-59a5-a7e1-25b7ccf0fcb5'}, {'abstract': 'Andrea Arnold’s new feature (her first set in the United States), with a cast mostly of newcomers, follows a band of aimless youths around the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/30/movies/american-honey-review-andrea-arnold.html', 'snippet': 'Andrea Arnold’s new feature (her first set in the United States), with a cast mostly of newcomers, follows a band of aimless youths around the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the shelf of essential cultural products whose names begin with the word “American,” Andrea Arnold’s new film (her fourth feature and the first set in the United States) might find a spot between Grant Wood’s “Gothic” and Green Day’s “Idiot.” This is not solely a matter of alphabetical order. “American Honey,” which takes its title from a song by Lady Antebellum, is a roaming, rambling road picture propelled by sex, hip-hop and close-ups of insects. It probes the murk and terror beneath the surface of contemporary life, and illuminates the vital role of ignorance, poor judgment and wishful thinking in our national character.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30AMHONEY/30AMHONEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30AMHONEY/30AMHONEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30AMHONEY/30AMHONEY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30AMHONEY/30AMHONEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30AMHONEY/30AMHONEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30AMHONEY/30AMHONEY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30AMHONEY/30AMHONEY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1199, 'width': 1599, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Youthful Recklessness Finds Adventure on the Road in ‘American Honey’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Adrift Amid Freeways and Amber Waves', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'American Honey (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARNOLD, ANDREA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LaBeouf, Shia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lane, Sasha (1995- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-29T11:00:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/d537ec9d-6752-508c-8d6c-902423191399', 'word_count': 902, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d537ec9d-6752-508c-8d6c-902423191399'}, {'abstract': 'The label’s spring 2017 collection', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2016/09/29/fashion/runway-womens/chloe-spring-2017.html', 'snippet': 'The label’s spring 2017 collection', 'le