ew — “All the Light We Cannot See,” by Anthony Doerr — went on to be an Editors’ Choice, a massive best seller (125 weeks on the hardcover fiction list and counting) and one of our 10 Best Books of 2014.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/books/review/02edchoice-1/02edchoice-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/02/books/review/02edchoice-1/02edchoice-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/books/review/02edchoice-1/02edchoice-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 288, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/02/books/review/02edchoice-1/02edchoice-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 288}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/books/review/02edchoice-1/02edchoice-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 460, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/books/review/02edchoice-1/02edchoice-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 460, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '9 New Books We Recommend This Week', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Editors’ Choice | Recent Books of Particular Interest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-29T18:44:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 's