ef-d304-5158-85da-0d19ee7196dc', 'word_count': 1409, 'uri': 'nyt://article/76e92def-d304-5158-85da-0d19ee7196dc'}, {'abstract': 'An American spokesman said the military was investigating reports of civilian casualties in the strike in the Islamic State stronghold of Achin district, in Nangarhar Province.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/30/world/asia/american-airstrike-afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'An American spokesman said the military was investigating reports of civilian casualties in the strike in the Islamic State stronghold of Achin district, in Nangarhar Province.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — The United Nations mission in Afghanistan on Thursday condemned an American airstrike it said had killed at least 15 civilians in eastern Afghanistan, a day after American and Afghan officials said they had targeted a gathering of Islamic State affiliates.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'American Airstrike Killed Afghan Civilians, U.N. Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Drones Hit Civilians, U.N. Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001-14)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mashal, Mujib', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nangarhar Province (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-29T20:22:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mujib Mashal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mujib', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mashal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/797ed673-cc48-5918-a004-be17babd2dff', 'word_count': 386, 'uri': 'nyt://article/797ed673-cc48-5918-a004-be17babd2dff'}, {'abstract': 'The neighborhood is a vivid presence in this new Netflix series, which stars Mike Colter as a literally bulletproof threat to a crime boss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/30/arts/television/review-marvels-luke-cage-a-hero-for-harlem.html', 'snippet': 'The neighborhood is a vivid presence in this new Netflix series, which stars Mike Colter as a literally bulletproof threat to a crime boss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the connected series of movies and television shows known as the Marvel Cinematic Universe, which occupies an inordinate amount of territory in our popular culture, there’s a quiet corner that belongs to Netflix. The Netflix-Marvel series, focusing on a mostly second-tier group of heroes — so far Daredevil, Jessica Jones and, beginning on Friday, Luke Cage — have been a laboratory in turning comic books into live-action TV without the noisy battles and tag-team group heroics of Marvel mainstays like the Avengers, X-Men and Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30CAGE/30CAGE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30CAGE/30CAGE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30CAGE/30CAGE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thum