nyt://article/0c4df649-aa0f-5f78-bc28-35ea11411190', 'word_count': 655, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c4df649-aa0f-5f78-bc28-35ea11411190'}, {'abstract': 'Terrance Brennan will cook at “Celebrate Our Love of the Hudson Valley” ahead of his new restaurant opening.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/29/dining/harvest-lunch-to-celebrate-hudson-valley.html', 'snippet': 'Terrance Brennan will cook at “Celebrate Our Love of the Hudson Valley” ahead of his new restaurant opening.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Glasses will be raised next month in the Hudson Valley to toast the harvest, a chef and an anniversary. On Oct. 8, the chef Terrance Brennan will prepare a three-course lunch as part of “Celebrate Our Love of the Hudson Valley,” an event to benefit the FarmOn! Foundation, which supports educational programs and local family farms. The meal will include local cheeses and charcuterie, pumpkin bisque, chicken grilled over wine vines and an array of apple desserts. The wine pairing will feature vintages from Clinton Vineyards, which is hosting the event and celebrating its 40th anniversary.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/dining/28BURNER-BRENNAN-WEB/28BURNER-BRENNAN-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/28/dining/28BURNER-BRENNAN-WEB/28BURNER-BRENNAN-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/dining/28BURNER-BRENNAN-WEB/28BURNER-BRENNAN-WEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/dining/28BURNER-BRENNAN-WEB/28BURNER-BRENNAN-WEB-