s://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/30/arts/design/chains-whips-and-misery-studying-and-preserving-old-lunatic-asylums.html', 'snippet': 'Several exhibitions and books, including “Bedlam: The Asylum and Beyond” at the Wellcome Collection in London, document the terrors experienced by patients.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mental hospitals have an unsettling history, which is the subject of many museum exhibitions and books this fall. The scholarship illuminates how for centuries reformers tried to prevent cruel treatment of the mentally ill and worked to develop architecture that would provide comfort while keeping patients away from the public. Historians and preservationists are trying to save the isolated buildings that resulted from these efforts and are poring over sometimes-forgotten archives.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30ANTIQUES1/30ANTIQUES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30ANTIQUES1/30ANTIQUES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30ANTIQUES1/30ANTIQUES1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30ANTIQUES1/30ANTIQUES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30ANTIQUES1/30ANTIQUES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30ANTIQUES1/30ANTIQUES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30ANTIQUES1/30ANTIQUES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1461, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Chains, Whips and Misery: Studying and Preserving Old ‘Lunatic’ Asylums', 'kicker': 'Antiques', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Chains, Whips, Misery: Studying and Preserving Old ‘Lunatic’ Asylums', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Trans-Allegheny Lunatic Asylum (Weston, W Va)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Building Museum', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (State)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychiatry and Psychiatrists', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Historic Buildings and Sites', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-29T20:22:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eve M. Kahn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63a01491-6c67-5411-ac4e-a373ea27e608', 'word_count': 918, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63a01491-6c67-5411-ac4e-a373ea27e608'}, {'abstract': 'This comedy from Jared Hess stars Zach Galifianakis as a real-life felon who tried to steal millions of dollars in 1997.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/30/movies/masterminds-review-zach-galifianakis.html', 'snippet': 'This comedy from Jared Hess stars Zach Galifianakis as a real-life felon who tried to steal millions of dollars in 1997.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I blame popular culture,” Zach Galifianakis says at the start of this comedy, the ridiculousness of his Southern accent rivaling that of his very fluffy hairstyle. His character, David Ghantt — a real-life felon who took part in an ostentatious crime in the late 1990s — is rationalizing his own miscreant deeds for the audience of “Masterminds,” a would-be memorable piece of popular culture that applies the TV-sketch-show-surreal-farce approach to a based-on-true-events caper picture.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30MASTERMINDS/30MASTERMINDS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30MASTERMINDS/30MASTERMINDS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30MASTERMINDS/30MASTERMINDS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30MASTERMINDS/30MASTERMINDS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30MASTERMINDS/30MASTERMINDS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xl