the two companies would be the latest consolidation in the chip-making industry and could be valued at over $30 billion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/30/business/dealbook/qualcomm-is-said-to-be-in-talks-to-buy-nxp-semiconductors.html', 'snippet': 'A merger of the two companies would be the latest consolidation in the chip-making industry and could be valued at over $30 billion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Qualcomm is in discussions to buy NXP Semiconductors in what would be another act of consolidation in the chip-making industry, a person briefed on the matter said on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Qualcomm Is Said to Be in Talks to Buy NXP Semiconductors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Qualcomm Said to Be in Talks to Buy NXP in Deal Potentially Worth $30 Billion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de la Merced, Michael J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Chips', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Qualcomm Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NXP Semiconductors NV', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-29T21:36:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/34a7861e-243a-589f-97ad-90190c2362b0', 'word_count': 382, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34a7861e-243a-589f-97ad-90190c2362b0'}, {'abstract': 'Brendan Toller’s documentary about the music manager and journalist Danny Fields aims to reacquaint viewers with his influence, including the rise of punk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/30/movies/review-danny-says-a-paean-to-a-rock-gadfly-and-tastemaker.html', 'snippet': 'Brendan Toller’s documentary about the music manager and journalist Danny Fields aims to reacquaint viewers with his influence, including the rise of punk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To hear it from the new documentary “Danny Says,” Danny Fields had a hand in the breakup of the Beatles and the discovery of the Ramones. He palled around with the photographer Linda Eastman (a.k.a. Linda McCartney). He tried playing matchmaker for Jim Morrison and Nico, an introduction that resulted in a strange stare-down. He signed MC5 and the Stooges to Elektra in one swoop. He tripped on acid on the floor of Leonard Cohen and Judy Collins’s hotel room.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DANNYSAYS/30DANNYSAYS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DANNYSAYS/30DANNYSAYS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DANNYSAYS/30DANNYSAYS-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DANNYSAYS/30DANNYSAYS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 458, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/30/arts/30DANNYSAYS/30DANNYSAYS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 458}}, {'