e Big Chocolate Show satisfies a sweet tooth in Chelsea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been four years since a chocolate show has been an autumn attraction in Manhattan. Wizard Studios of Bushwick, Brooklyn, brings its Big Chocolate Show to Terminal Stores in Chelsea on Oct. 8 and 9, with tasting classes, hourly cooking demonstrations and other events included in the admission. Tickets are sold for half-day segments, from 9 a.m. to 1:30 p.m. and from 2:30 to 7 p.m., and reservations for various classes are available with ticket purchase.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/dining/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/29/dining/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/dining/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/dining/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 372, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/29/dining/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 372}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/29/dining/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB/29BURNER-CHOCOLATE-WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 620, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'su