ea has actually become in the Middle East.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/01/world/middleeast/shimon-peres-funeral.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama and others paid homage to Mr. Peres’s tenacious search for reconciliation, yet the service made clear how elusive that idea has actually become in the Middle East.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — From across the ocean and across the Green Line, they came on Friday to the mountaintop sanctuary of Mount Herzl to bid farewell to Shimon Peres, marking what one called the “end of the era of giants.” But the question of the moment was whether it was a funeral for a man or for his dream.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'World Leaders Gather to Mourn Shimon Peres, and Possibly His Dream', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World Leaders Gather to Mourn Peres, and Possibly His Dream', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baker, Peter', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peres, Shimon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Funerals and Memorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-30T06:54:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac99e4ac-4780-5c97-84cd-191821c99963', 'word_count': 1460, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac99e4ac-4780-5c97-84cd-191821c99963'}, {'abs