ican Republic after the Hurricane Inez hits the Caribbean in October 1891.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/09/30/1966-caribbean-hurricane-kills-110/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: Hundreds of people die in Haiti and the Dominican Republic after the Hurricane Inez hits the Caribbean in October 1891.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — Haiti and the Dominican Republic suffered hundreds of deaths and disastrous destruction from Hurricane Inez, first reports indicated today [Sept. 30]. The killer Hurricane then slashed across eastern Cuba on a course aimed at the Bahamas. A government spokesman for the Dominican Republic late today listed 110 known dead. The casualty toll was expected to grow higher. An air-force spokesman said several small cities in the interior had not been heard from. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/blogs/01oldiht-1966-hurricane/01oldiht-1966-hurricane-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/01/blogs/01oldiht-1966-hurricane/01oldiht-1966-hurricane-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/blogs/01oldiht-1966-hurricane/01oldiht-1966-hurricane-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/blogs/01oldiht-1966-hurricane/01oldiht-1966-hurricane-jumbo.png', 'height': 341, 'width': 349, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/blogs/01