ponse-from-cbs-on-merger-request.html', 'snippet': 'A day after the family stated its desire to merge Viacom with CBS, Viacom formed an independent board committee to consider the move.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A day after the Redstone family formally called for a reunification of its media empire, meaning a merger of CBS and Viacom, Viacom has unveiled an independent board committee to review the proposal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Redstones Await Response From CBS on Merger Request', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Viacom Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Redstone, Shari', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moonves, Leslie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-09-30T23:19:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a259bf56-9c2b-57fd-b31c-81b17b28ea75', 'word_count': 316, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a259bf56-9c2b-57fd-b31c-81b17b28ea75'}, {'abstract': 'He and his sister were well known to Americans when they lived with their mother and grandparents in the White House in the 1930s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/01/us/curtis-roosevelt-dead.html', 'snippet': 'He and his sister were well known to Americans when they lived with their mother and grandparents in the White House in the 1930s.', 'lea